MU_I18N({"'You can't win anything with kids.' Ince, Hughes and Kanchelskis were sold in the summer; Beckham, Scholes, Butt, Gary Neville and Phil Neville came in, and United lost the opening day at Villa Park. Newcastle were 12 points clear in January; Cantona, back from his eight-month ban, scored the only goal in six of United's wins in the spring, including at St James' Park. The title was sealed 3–0 at Middlesbrough on the last day, and Cantona's late volley beat Liverpool in the final for a second Double.":"‘You can't win anything with kids.’ Díoladh Ince, Hughes agus Kanchelskis sa samhradh; tháinig Beckham, Scholes, Butt, Gary Neville agus Phil Neville isteach, agus chaill United an chéad lá ag Villa Park. Bhí Newcastle 12 phointe chun tosaigh in Eanáir; scóráil Cantona, ar ais tar éis a choisc ocht mí, an t-aon chúl i sé cinn de bhuanna United san earrach, ag St James' Park san áireamh. Séalaíodh an teideal 3–0 ag Middlesbrough an lá deiridh, agus bhuaigh volaí déanach Cantona ar Liverpool sa chluiche ceannais don dara Dúbailt.","1986–2013. 1496 matches, 893 won, 337 drawn, 266 lost (60% wins). 13 Premier League titles, 5 FA Cups, 4 League Cups, 10 Community Shields (inc. 1 shared), 2 UEFA Champions Leagues, 1 European Cup Winners' Cup, 1 European Super Cup, 1 Intercontinental Cup, 1 FIFA Club World Cup.":"1986–2013. 1496 cluiche, 893 buaite, 337 cothrom, 266 caillte (60% buanna). 13 theideal Premier League, 5 FA Cup, 4 Chorn na Sraithe, 10 Community Shield (1 roinnte san áireamh), 2 Shraith na Seaimpíní UEFA, 1 Chorn Bhuaiteoirí Chorn na hEorpa, 1 Sárchorn Eorpach, 1 Chorn Idir-Ilchríochach, 1 Chorn Domhanda na gClubanna FIFA.","1–0 aet against Everton at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Ron Atkinson. Scorers: Whiteside. Moran was initially refused a medal; the FA relented. Moran became the first man sent off in an FA Cup final; ten men held the champions, and Whiteside curled the winner past Southall in extra time.":"1–0 t.a.b. in aghaidh Everton ag Wembley Stadium. Bainisteoir: Ron Atkinson. Scórálaithe: Whiteside. Diúltaíodh bonn do Moran ar dtús; ghéill an FA. Ba é Moran an chéad fhear a cuireadh den pháirc i gcluiche ceannais an FA Cup; choinnigh deichniúr na seaimpíní siar, agus chuar Whiteside cúl an bhua thar Southall san am breise.","1–0 against Liverpool at Wembley (original). Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: Cantona. James punched a corner out; Cantona, adjusting his body on the edge of the box, volleyed through the crowd. Liverpool's white suits are the other memory.":"1–0 in aghaidh Liverpool ag Wembley (bunaidh). Bainisteoir: Alex Ferguson. Scórálaithe: Cantona. Bhuail James cic coirnéil amach lena dhorn; chuir Cantona, ag socrú a choirp ar imeall an bhosca, volaí tríd an slua. Is iad cultacha bána Liverpool an chuimhne eile.","1–0 against Nottingham Forest at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: McClair. Giggs set it up. Forest had beaten United in the 1990 FA Cup quarter and the 1991 League Cup; this was the first final between the clubs.":"1–0 in aghaidh Nottingham Forest ag Wembley Stadium. Bainisteoir: Alex Ferguson. Scórálaithe: McClair. Ullmhaigh Giggs é. Bhuaigh Forest ar United i gcluiche ceathrú ceannais an FA Cup 1990 agus i gCorn na Sraithe 1991; ba é seo an chéad chluiche ceannais idir an dá chlub.","1–1, 6–5 on penalties against Chelsea. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: Ronaldo. Drogba sent off in extra time for a slap on Vidić. Giggs, on for Scholes, broke Charlton's appearance record and scored the decisive penalty. Ronaldo's header, Lampard's equaliser, Drogba sent off in extra time; Ronaldo missed his penalty, Terry slipped, van der Sar saved from Anelka. Won 6–5 on penalties.":"1–1, 6–5 ar chiceanna éirice in aghaidh Chelsea. Bainisteoir: Alex Ferguson. Scórálaithe: Ronaldo. Drogba curtha den pháirc san am breise as boiseog a thabhairt do Vidić. Bhris Giggs, a tháinig ar an bpáirc in áit Scholes, taifead láithrithe Charlton agus scóráil sé an cic éirice cinniúnach. Cúl ceann Ronaldo, cúl cothromaithe Lampard, Drogba curtha den pháirc san am breise; chaill Ronaldo a chic éirice, shleamhnaigh Terry, shábháil van der Sar ó Anelka. Bua 6–5 ar chiceanna éirice.","2–1 against Bayern Munich. Manager: Alex Ferguson. Scorers: Sheringham, Solskjær. Keane and Scholes suspended. Bayern hit the woodwork twice through Scholl and Jancker before the two corners. 'Football, bloody hell.' Basler's free-kick after six minutes, nothing for 84 more, then Sheringham from Giggs' scuff in the 91st and Solskjær's toe-poke from Sheringham's flick in the 93rd. The Treble.":"2–1 in aghaidh Bayern Munich. Bainisteoir: Alex Ferguson. Scórálaithe: Sheringham, Solskjær. Keane agus Scholes ar fionraí. Bhuail Bayern an fráma faoi dhó trí Scholl agus Jancker roimh an dá chic choirnéil. ‘Football, bloody hell.’ Cic saor Basler tar éis sé nóiméad, faic ar feadh 84 eile, ansin Sheringham ó bhuille lochtach Giggs sa 91ú agus cic barr coise Solskjær ó chlipeáil Sheringham sa 93ú. An Trébhuach.","4–0 in the replay after 2–2 against Brighton & Hove Albion at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Ron Atkinson. Scorers: Robson 2, Whiteside, Mühren. Robson declined the penalty that would have given him a hat-trick and handed it to Muhren.":"4–0 san athimirt tar éis 2–2 in aghaidh Brighton & Hove Albion ag Wembley Stadium. Bainisteoir: Ron Atkinson. Scórálaithe: Robson 2, Whiteside, Mühren. Dhiúltaigh Robson don chic éirice a thabharfadh haitric dó agus thug sé do Muhren é.","4–1 aet against Benfica at Wembley Stadium. Manager: Matt Busby. Scorers: Charlton 2, Best, Kidd. Stepney's save from Eusébio in the last minute of normal time kept it level. Kidd scored on his 19th birthday. First English winners.":"4–1 t.a.b. in aghaidh Benfica ag Wembley Stadium. Bainisteoir: Matt Busby. Scórálaithe: Charlton 2, Best, Kidd. Choinnigh sábháil Stepney ó Eusébio sa nóiméad deireanach den ghnáth-am cothrom é. Scóráil Kidd ar a 19ú breithlá. Na chéad bhuaiteoirí Sasanacha.","A bag or backpack is allowed if it is small enough to fit under your seat, subject to a full search at the turnstiles; larger luggage can be left free of charge at the Information Centre by Entrance 9, open three hours before kick-off until 30 minutes after the final whistle. Banned items include knives, fireworks, smoke canisters, air horns, flares, weapons, laser devices, bottles, glass, cans, poles and drones; only soft drinks under one litre in factory-sealed plastic bottles may be brought in, no alcohol.":"Ceadaítear mála nó mála droma má tá sé beag go leor le dul faoi do shuíochán, faoi réir cuardach iomlán ag na geataí casta; is féidir bagáiste níos mó a fhágáil saor in aisce ag an Information Centre in aice le Bealach Isteach 9, ar oscailt ó thrí huaire an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh go dtí 30 nóiméad tar éis na feadóige deiridh. I measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá sceana, tinte ealaíne, canna deataigh, adharca aeir, bladhmanna, airm, gléasanna léasair, buidéil, gloine, cannaí, cuaillí agus dróin; ní féidir ach deochanna boga faoi lítear amháin i mbuidéil phlaisteacha séalaithe sa mhonarcha a thabhairt isteach, gan alcól.","A curated shelf rather than everything ever published: what each one adds, and where to find it. Tick what you've done — that's kept in this browser. Streaming availability moves between regions, so the \"where\" is the publisher or the platform that first carried it.":"Seilf roghnaithe seachas gach rud a foilsíodh riamh: cad a chuireann gach ceann leis, agus cá háit lena fháil. Cuir tic le gach a bhfuil déanta agat — coinnítear é sin sa bhrabhsálaí seo. Athraíonn infhaighteacht sruthaithe ó réigiún go réigiún, mar sin is é an “cá háit” an foilsitheoir nó an t-ardán a chraol ar dtús é.","A fourth title in five years, won with the lowest points total of Ferguson's championships and a European Cup semi-final lost to Borussia Dortmund. Solskjær, an unknown £1.5m signing from Molde, finished top scorer; Beckham scored from halfway at Selhurst Park on the opening day and was PFA Young Player of the Year. The title was confirmed on 6 May when Liverpool and Newcastle both failed to win; Cantona retired twelve days later, at 30.":"An ceathrú teideal i gcúig bliana, buaite leis an iomlán pointí is ísle de chraobhacha Ferguson agus cluiche leathcheannais Chorn na hEorpa caillte in aghaidh Borussia Dortmund. Chríochnaigh Solskjær, síniú anaithnid £1.5m ó Molde, mar phríomhscórálaí; scóráil Beckham ó lár na páirce ag Selhurst Park an chéad lá agus ba é Imreoir Óg na Bliana PFA. Deimhníodh an teideal ar an 6 Bealtaine nuair a theip ar Liverpool agus ar Newcastle buachan; d’éirigh Cantona as dhá lá dhéag ina dhiaidh sin, ag 30.","After evening games the trains back to London are limited, usually 22:23 and 22:43, and there are no post-match options at all on the Peterborough line after evening matches. The Portman Road car park exit is closed for 15-20 minutes after the game while pedestrians clear and nearby roads take at least an hour to clear. Last trains to Manchester: not stated.":"Tar éis cluichí tráthnóna tá na traenacha ar ais go Londain teoranta, de ghnáth 22:23 agus 22:43, agus níl aon rogha ar chor ar bith tar éis an chluiche ar líne Peterborough tar éis cluichí tráthnóna. Dúntar slí amach charrchlós Portman Road ar feadh 15-20 nóiméad tar éis an chluiche fad a ghlantar coisithe agus tógann bóithre in aice láimhe uair an chloig ar a laghad le glanadh. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain: níl siad luaite.","After the game, segregation means away fans cannot turn left towards Arena Shopping Park; you are directed across Car Park B (where away coaches park) and left at the exit gate to reach the shopping park and the train station. The A444 Jimmy Hill Way is closed for a short period after every match. Shuttle buses back to the city centre leave Arena Park from two hours after kick-off at half-hour intervals (for a 3pm game 17:00 to 18:30); expect station queues and gridlocked roads. Last trains to Manchester or London: not stated.":"Tar éis an chluiche, mar gheall ar dheighilt ní féidir le lucht leanúna as baile casadh ar chlé i dtreo Arena Shopping Park; treoraítear thú trasna Charrchlós B (áit a bpáirceálann cóistí na gcuairteoirí) agus ar chlé ag geata na slí amach chun an t-ionad siopadóireachta agus an stáisiún traenach a bhaint amach. Dúntar an A444 Jimmy Hill Way ar feadh tamaill ghearr tar éis gach cluiche. Fágann busanna tointeála ar ais go lár na cathrach Arena Park ó dhá uair an chloig tar éis an chic tosaigh gach leathuair (do chluiche 3pm 17:00 go 18:30); bí ag súil le scuainí ag an stáisiún agus bóithre plódaithe. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain nó go Londain: níl siad luaite.","After the match, Metro passengers heading north towards Newcastle must board at Stadium of Light station, while those heading south must board at St Peter's. Expect heavy traffic and a residents-only parking scheme nearby; the Park and Ride buses continue running after the game. Last trains to Manchester or London: not stated.":"Tar éis an chluiche, caithfidh paisinéirí Metro atá ag dul ó thuaidh i dtreo Newcastle dul ar bord ag stáisiún Stadium of Light, agus iad siúd atá ag dul ó dheas ag St Peter's. Bí ag súil le trácht trom agus scéim páirceála do chónaitheoirí amháin in aice láimhe; leanann busanna Park and Ride ag rith tar éis an chluiche. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain nó go Londain: níl siad luaite.","All South Stand kiosks and the club shop are cashless. Have your barcode ticket ready for the scanners and allow time for searches; arriving 15 minutes before kick-off means queuing. No re-admission; a half-time smoking area is outside the South Stand; drums are not allowed in the away end and flags need prior approval via safety@ccfc.co.uk. Car Park C is the closest paid parking to the South Stand.":"Tá gach cioscóg sa South Stand agus siopa an chlub gan airgead tirim. Bíodh do thicéad barrachóid réidh do na scanóirí agus fág am do chuardaigh; má thagann tú 15 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh beidh ort scuaine a dhéanamh. Gan athiontráil; tá limistéar tobac leath-ama lasmuigh den South Stand; níl cead drumaí i gceann na gcuairteoirí agus teastaíonn réamhcheadú trí safety@ccfc.co.uk ó bhratacha. Is é Car Park C an pháirceáil íoctha is gaire don South Stand.","All away fixtures are all-ticket with no sales on the day; the away ticket collection window is next to the away turnstiles. Portman Road is cashless, including programmes (sold only outside the ground). Allow at least an extra hour for train travel because of frequent weekend engineering works, and check the club's match-specific guide sent to United about two weeks before the game; no re-admission.":"Is ticéid amháin gach cluiche as baile gan díolachán ar an lá; tá fuinneog bhailiúcháin na dticéad as baile in aice le geataí casta na gcuairteoirí. Tá Portman Road gan airgead tirim, cláir chluiche san áireamh (díolta lasmuigh den staid amháin). Fág uair an chloig bhreise ar a laghad do thaisteal traenach mar gheall ar oibreacha innealtóireachta minice ag an deireadh seachtaine, agus seiceáil treoir an chlub don chluiche sonrach a sheoltar chuig United thart ar choicís roimh an gcluiche; gan athiontráil.","Anfield is fully cashless (contactless or chip-and-PIN). Everyone is searched and pyro detection dogs may be present, so arrive early; fans without tickets are urged not to travel. Alcohol is served on the visiting concourse but cannot be consumed in view of the pitch, and the ground is no-smoking including e-cigarettes. Ticket collection: not stated (Ticket Office is under the Kop).":"Tá Anfield go hiomlán gan airgead tirim (gan teagmháil nó sliseanna agus PIN). Cuardaítear gach duine agus d’fhéadfadh madraí a aimsíonn piteicnic a bheith i láthair, mar sin tar go luath; iarrtar ar lucht leanúna gan ticéid gan taisteal. Díoltar alcól ar halla na gcuairteoirí ach ní féidir é a ól i radharc na páirce, agus níl cead tobac a chaitheamh sa staid, ríthoitíní san áireamh. Bailiú ticéad: níl sé luaite (tá an Oifig Ticéad faoin Kop).","Arrive no later than 60 minutes before kick-off; expect at least two search and ticket-check points on the approach. The Etihad is cashless. Pre-arranged ticket collections are at the South Stand Ticket Office from two hours before kick-off with photo ID, and tickets are not reprinted on the day, so arrange collection through United; download mobile tickets before arriving. No re-admission; under-14s must be with an adult.":"Tar 60 nóiméad ar a dhéanaí roimh an gcic tosaigh; bí ag súil le dhá phointe cuardaigh agus seiceála ticéad ar a laghad ar an mbealach isteach. Tá an Etihad gan airgead tirim. Bíonn bailiúcháin ticéad réamhshocraithe ag Oifig Ticéad an South Stand ó dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh le haitheantas grianghrafach, agus ní athphriontáiltear ticéid ar an lá, mar sin socraigh bailiúchán trí United; íoslódáil ticéid soghluaiste sula dtagann tú. Gan athiontráil; ní foláir do dhaoine faoi 14 a bheith le duine fásta.","Arsenal (Piccadilly line) is the nearest station, about three minutes' walk, but has no step-free access; Finsbury Park (Victoria and Piccadilly lines, Great Northern rail) and Highbury & Islington (Victoria line, Mildmay line, Great Northern rail) are each about a 10-minute walk. From King's Cross take the Piccadilly line to Arsenal or the Victoria line to Highbury & Islington. Holloway Road is exit-only before matches and eastbound trains do not stop there; Drayton Park is closed on matchdays. Buses stop on Holloway Road, Nag's Head, Seven Sisters Road, Blackstock Road and Highbury Corner; the club strongly advises against driving as an Event Day Parking Scheme covers the area.":"Is é Arsenal (líne Piccadilly) an stáisiún is gaire, thart ar thrí nóiméad siúil, ach níl rochtain gan chéimeanna ann; tá Finsbury Park (línte Victoria agus Piccadilly, iarnród Great Northern) agus Highbury & Islington (líne Victoria, líne Mildmay, iarnród Great Northern) thart ar 10 nóiméad siúil an ceann. Ó King's Cross tóg an líne Piccadilly go Arsenal nó an líne Victoria go Highbury & Islington. Is slí amach amháin é Holloway Road roimh chluichí agus ní stopann traenacha soir ann; bíonn Drayton Park dúnta ar laethanta cluiche. Stopann busanna ar Holloway Road, Nag's Head, Seven Sisters Road, Blackstock Road agus Highbury Corner; molann an club go láidir gan tiomáint mar go gclúdaíonn Event Day Parking Scheme an ceantar.","Arsenal's pages name no pubs. Football Ground Guide names the Drayton Park pub (formerly the Drayton Arms, opposite the large ARSENAL letters, often called the away pub), the Twelve Pins near Finsbury Park station (away fans sometimes welcome in small groups) and The Coronet Wetherspoons on Holloway Road, all within a 10-minute walk, and suggests drinking in central London before taking the tube.":"Ní ainmníonn leathanaigh Arsenal aon teach tábhairne. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide teach tábhairne Drayton Park (an Drayton Arms roimhe, os comhair na litreacha móra ARSENAL, ar a dtugtar teach tábhairne na gcuairteoirí go minic), an Twelve Pins gar do stáisiún Finsbury Park (fáilte uaireanta roimh lucht leanúna as baile i ngrúpaí beaga) agus The Coronet Wetherspoons ar Holloway Road, iad uile laistigh de 10 nóiméad siúil, agus molann sé ól i lár Londan sula dtógann tú an tiúb.","At Tottenham's 2022 visit the away section was on two levels: level 0 blocks A9 and A11 (turnstile A) and level 4 blocks B7, B9, B11 and B13 (turnstile B), reached via Gate 1 with safety netting across the whole visiting area; you cannot move between levels. The standard UEFA allocation is around 2,500 and United's own travel guide will confirm the gate. Turnstiles open two hours before kick-off.":"Ag cuairt Tottenham in 2022 bhí rannóg na gcuairteoirí ar dhá leibhéal: leibhéal 0 bloic A9 agus A11 (geata casta A) agus leibhéal 4 bloic B7, B9, B11 agus B13 (geata casta B), le dul isteach trí Gheata 1 agus líontán sábháilteachta trasna limistéar iomlán na gcuairteoirí; ní féidir bogadh idir leibhéil. Is é thart ar 2,500 an leithdháileadh caighdeánach UEFA agus deimhneoidh treoir taistil United féin an geata. Osclaíonn na geataí casta dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh.","Atkinson's first trophy, after losing the League Cup final to Liverpool in March. Brighton, already relegated, drew the final 2–2 — Gordon Smith's miss in the last minute of extra time became a radio catchphrase — and United won the replay 4–0 five days later with two from Robson. Norman Whiteside, 18, scored in both the League Cup and FA Cup finals that season.":"An chéad chorn ag Atkinson, tar éis cluiche ceannais Chorn na Sraithe a chailleadh in aghaidh Liverpool i Márta. Chríochnaigh Brighton, a bhí íslithe cheana, an cluiche ceannais 2–2 — rinneadh frása raidió den deis a chaill Gordon Smith sa nóiméad deireanach den am breise — agus bhuaigh United an athimirt 4–0 cúig lá ina dhiaidh sin le dhá chúl ó Robson. Scóráil Norman Whiteside, 18, i gcluiche ceannais Chorn na Sraithe agus an FA Cup araon an séasúr sin.","Away Ticket Office is beside turnstiles 91/92, open from 1.5 hours before kick-off; download digital tickets before arriving and charge your phone. Contactless is encouraged at kiosks, with cash accepted only at a limited number of locations. The Level 7 concourse sells burgers, pies, hot and cold drinks with vegetarian and halal options; alcohol is sold before kick-off and at half-time.":"Tá Oifig Ticéad na gCuairteoirí in aice le geataí casta 91/92, ar oscailt ó 1.5 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh; íoslódáil ticéid dhigiteacha sula dtagann tú agus luchtaigh do ghuthán. Spreagtar íocaíocht gan teagmháil ag na ciosceanna, agus ní ghlactar le hairgead tirim ach ag líon teoranta áiteanna. Díolann halla Leibhéal 7 burgair, pióga, deochanna te agus fuara le roghanna vegetarian agus halal; díoltar alcól roimh an gcic tosaigh agus ag leath-am.","Away fans are discouraged from using Kew Bridge after the match; if you do, walk from Capital Interchange Way up Lionel Road South and join the same queue as home fans. Gunnersbury station does not open until an hour after the final whistle and queues are likely. Taxis take longer after the game. Last-train times: not stated.":"Moltar do lucht leanúna as baile gan Kew Bridge a úsáid tar éis an chluiche; má dhéanann tú, siúil ó Capital Interchange Way suas Lionel Road South agus téigh sa scuaine chéanna le lucht leanúna an fhoirne baile. Ní osclaíonn stáisiún Gunnersbury go dtí uair an chloig tar éis na feadóige deiridh agus is dócha go mbeidh scuainí ann. Tógann tacsaithe níos faide tar éis an chluiche. Amanna na traenach deireanaí: níl siad luaite.","Away fans are held back for roughly 15 to 30 minutes after the final whistle until police release them; toilets and kiosks stay open. Return to the centre on the Green line from Telheiras, or stay on the away side of the stadium for taxis or Uber. Last metro times: not stated (the Lisbon metro normally runs until about 01:00 - unverified).":"Coinnítear lucht leanúna an fhoirne as baile siar ar feadh thart ar 15 go 30 nóiméad tar éis na feadóige deiridh go dtí go scaoileann na póilíní iad; fanann leithris agus ciosceanna ar oscailt. Fill ar an lár ar an líne Ghlas ó Telheiras, nó fan ar thaobh na gcuairteoirí den staid le haghaidh tacsaithe nó Uber. Amanna an mheitreo dheireanaigh: níl siad luaite (de ghnáth ritheann meitreo Liospóin go dtí thart ar 01:00 - gan deimhniú).","Away fans are in the Bridgford Stand (lower Bridgford Block W is safe standing). Enter via the turnstile printed on your digital ticket - away turnstiles are in the range 41-53 behind the Bridgford Stand, next to the Visitors' Ticket Office. Turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off; most close 10 minutes after kick-off, a few stay open for late-comers. No re-entry.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa Bridgford Stand (is seasamh sábháilte é Bridgford Block W íochtarach). Téigh isteach tríd an ngeata casta atá priontáilte ar do thicéad digiteach - tá geataí casta na gcuairteoirí sa raon 41-53 taobh thiar den Bridgford Stand, in aice le hOifig Ticéad na gCuairteoirí. Osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh; dúnann a bhformhór 10 nóiméad tar éis an chic tosaigh, fanann cúpla ceann ar oscailt do dhaoine déanacha. Gan athiontráil.","Away fans are in the Cobbold Stand, in blocks VU1, VU2 and VU3 (safe standing, upper tier) and VL and VA (seated); buy a seated ticket if you cannot stand for long periods, and there is no lift to the upper tier. Away turnstiles are 10/11, 12/13 and 14/15/16/17, with the away accessible entrance alongside; turnstiles open 90 minutes before daytime kick-offs and 75 minutes before evening games.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa Cobbold Stand, i mbloic VU1, VU2 agus VU3 (seasamh sábháilte, an leibhéal uachtarach) agus VL agus VA (suíochán); ceannaigh ticéad suíocháin mura féidir leat seasamh ar feadh tréimhsí fada, agus níl ardaitheoir go dtí an leibhéal uachtarach. Is iad geataí casta na gcuairteoirí 10/11, 12/13 agus 14/15/16/17, le bealach isteach inrochtana na gcuairteoirí lena dtaobh; osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh chic tosaigh i rith an lae agus 75 nóiméad roimh chluichí tráthnóna.","Away fans are in the East Stand (blocks N120, E115-E117 and E215-E218). Use away entrances F, G or H off Capital Interchange Way; turnstile G is the accessible entrance via a lift from Thomas Layton Way. Turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and there is no re-entry.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile san East Stand (bloic N120, E115-E117 agus E215-E218). Úsáid bealaí isteach na gcuairteoirí F, G nó H amach ó Capital Interchange Way; is é geata casta G an bealach isteach inrochtana trí ardaitheoir ó Thomas Layton Way. Osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh agus níl athiontráil ann.","Away fans are in the Shed End (South Stand), split across Shed Lower and Shed Upper, on the right-hand side as you face the stand; both are safe-standing rail-seat areas. The ticket office behind the Shed End next to the Megastore handles away enquiries. Entry readers open about 90 minutes before kick-off; the club does not publish turnstile letters.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa Shed End (South Stand), roinnte idir Shed Lower agus Shed Upper, ar thaobh na láimhe deise agus tú ag féachaint ar an ardán; is limistéir sheasaimh shábháilte le suíocháin ráille iad araon. Láimhseálann an oifig ticéad taobh thiar den Shed End in aice leis an Megastore fiosruithe na gcuairteoirí. Osclaíonn léitheoirí iontrála thart ar 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh; ní fhoilsíonn an club litreacha na ngeataí casta.","Away fans are in the South Stand (blocks S1A/S1B to S1F), about 600 yards from Falmer station. Away tickets are processed through Entrance 28 (turnstile gates 28-31 were used for visiting fans in May 2026); turnstiles open 2 hours before kick-off.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa South Stand (bloic S1A/S1B go S1F), thart ar 600 slat ó stáisiún Falmer. Próiseáiltear ticéid as baile trí Bhealach Isteach 28 (úsáideadh geataí casta 28-31 do lucht leanúna cuairte i mBealtaine 2026); osclaíonn na geataí casta 2 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh.","Away fans are in the South Stand (right-hand side behind the goal, across three tiers) and should use entrances L1, L2 and L3, which open two hours before kick-off; the first two tiers are preferred for the view. Away coaches park in the Grey Car Park opposite the away turnstiles.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa South Stand (an taobh deas taobh thiar den chúl, trasna trí leibhéal) agus ba cheart dóibh bealaí isteach L1, L2 agus L3 a úsáid, a osclaíonn dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh; is fearr an dá leibhéal íochtaracha don radharc. Páirceálann cóistí na gcuairteoirí sa Grey Car Park os comhair gheataí casta na gcuairteoirí.","Away fans are in the South Stand, usually blocks 6-9, with safe standing in blocks 6 and 7 and a wheelchair platform at the front of block 8 accessed via Gate 25; the South Stand is not connected to the other stands. Specific turnstile numbers are shown on your ticket; turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and the away late turnstile is number 5.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa South Stand, bloic 6-9 de ghnáth, le seasamh sábháilte i mbloic 6 agus 7 agus ardán cathaoireacha rothaí ag tosach bhloc 8 trí Gheata 25; níl an South Stand ceangailte leis na hardáin eile. Taispeántar uimhreacha sonracha na ngeataí casta ar do thicéad; osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh agus is é uimhir 5 geata casta déanach na gcuairteoirí.","Away fans are in the Vitality East Stand, blocks 21 to 24, in one corner of the stand, entered via Turnstile F; there is an away-accessible entrance next to the away turnstiles. Turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa Vitality East Stand, bloic 21 go 24, i gcúinne amháin den ardán, le dul isteach trí Gheata Casta F; tá bealach isteach inrochtana do na cuairteoirí in aice le geataí casta na gcuairteoirí. Osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh.","Away fans are in the lower tier of the south-east corner, between the East Stand and the Clock End (just under 3000 for Premier League games). Enter via turnstiles K and L at the south-east corner; turnstiles open 120 minutes before kick-off and Arsenal recommends arriving at least 60 minutes before kick-off, using the Clock End Bridge from Arsenal station as it is quieter than the North Bank Bridge.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa leibhéal íochtarach den chúinne thoir theas, idir an East Stand agus an Clock End (beagán faoi 3000 do chluichí Premier League). Téigh isteach trí gheataí casta K agus L ag an gcúinne thoir theas; osclaíonn na geataí casta 120 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh agus molann Arsenal teacht 60 nóiméad ar a laghad roimh an gcic tosaigh, ag úsáid an Clock End Bridge ó stáisiún Arsenal mar go bhfuil sé níos ciúine ná an North Bank Bridge.","Away fans are in the north-east corner of the Doug Ellis Stand: Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (about 1600 seats) via turnstiles Q91-Q96B, and Doug Ellis Upper Block P (about 1300 seats) via turnstiles P87, P88, P88A and P89 (64 steps to the upper concourse). Turnstiles open about 90 minutes before kick-off; late arrivals can use Q96 and/or P89 until the second half starts.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa chúinne thoir thuaidh den Doug Ellis Stand: Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (thart ar 1600 suíochán) trí gheataí casta Q91-Q96B, agus Doug Ellis Upper Block P (thart ar 1300 suíochán) trí gheataí casta P87, P88, P88A agus P89 (64 céim go dtí an halla uachtarach). Osclaíonn na geataí casta thart ar 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh; is féidir le daoine déanacha Q96 agus/nó P89 a úsáid go dtí go dtosaíonn an dara leath.","Away fans are in the upper tier of the Fondo Norte (North Stand) behind the goal, a steep tier used exclusively for visitors; allocations are small (around 1,100-1,200 is typical). For United's 2021 visit the entry point was Gate 25; the away gate is confirmed by United per fixture, with ID and bag checks at several cordons.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa leibhéal uachtarach den Fondo Norte (North Stand) taobh thiar den chúl, leibhéal géar a úsáidtear do chuairteoirí amháin; bíonn leithdháiltí beag (thart ar 1,100-1,200 de ghnáth). Do chuairt United in 2021 ba é Geata 25 an pointe iontrála; deimhníonn United geata na gcuairteoirí do gach cluiche, le seiceálacha aitheantais agus málaí ag roinnt cordún.","Away fans are in the upper tier of the North Stand, entering through turnstiles 69-74, which open 90 minutes before kick-off. Fans needing lift access should go to the 76 Yards entrance and ask stewards for the lift to level 3. Standard away allocation is around 3000.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile sa leibhéal uachtarach den North Stand, ag dul isteach trí gheataí casta 69-74, a osclaíonn 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh. Ba cheart do lucht leanúna a bhfuil rochtain ardaitheora uathu dul go bealach isteach 76 Yards agus an t-ardaitheoir go leibhéal 3 a iarraidh ar na maoir. Is é thart ar 3000 an gnáthleithdháileadh as baile.","Away fans are on Level 7 of the Leazes Stand (the Leazes End, top tier), reached by 140 steps and 14 landings with a lift available on request from a steward. Use turnstiles 89-94 in the Leazes Stand (normally 91-94) according to the access number on your ticket; turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and step-free access is near turnstiles 93-94.":"Tá lucht leanúna as baile ar Leibhéal 7 den Leazes Stand (an Leazes End, an leibhéal is airde), a shroichtear trí 140 céim agus 14 léibheann le hardaitheoir ar fáil ach é a iarraidh ar mhaor. Úsáid geataí casta 89-94 sa Leazes Stand (91-94 de ghnáth) de réir na huimhreach rochtana ar do thicéad; osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh agus tá rochtain gan chéimeanna gar do gheataí casta 93-94.","Away fans may be held back briefly after the final whistle while nearby areas clear, by agreement with Greater Manchester Police, with PA announcements. Tram queues at Etihad Campus can be up to 30 minutes and many fans prefer the 25-30 minute walk back to Piccadilly along the A662; TfGM also runs post-match shuttle buses. Last trains to London: not stated.":"D’fhéadfaí lucht leanúna as baile a choinneáil siar ar feadh tamaill ghearr tar éis na feadóige deiridh fad a ghlantar na limistéir máguaird, de réir comhaontú le Greater Manchester Police, le fógraí ar an gcóras fógartha. D’fhéadfadh scuainí tram ag Etihad Campus a bheith suas le 30 nóiméad agus is fearr le go leor lucht leanúna an tsiúlóid 25-30 nóiméad ar ais go Piccadilly feadh an A662; ritheann TfGM busanna tointeála tar éis an chluiche freisin. Traenacha deireanacha go Londain: níl siad luaite.","Away fixtures, allocations and ballot dates read from the away-tickets page on tickets.manutd.com on 29 Oct 2026; away kick-off dates are the TV-selected ones and may still move. Home fixtures, kick-offs and seat availability read from tickets.manutd.com on 2 Nov 2026 (1 adult, logged in as an Official Member); blocks sell out and get released, so check before booking. Flight and hotel prices were checked on SlickTrip on 29 Oct 2026 for 1 adult and will have moved; round-trip fares are \"from\" prices pairing the named outbound with its cheapest return. Hotels are 4-star and up only (Hotel Football, the Marriott family, the high-end city hotels and those near the ground); prices are for the exact fixture night, cheapest room, 1 adult, and the hotel's own page shows the live rate and all sellers. Weather is the Open-Meteo forecast inside 16 days, otherwise Manchester's seasonal averages. Hosted versions of this page fetch live weather; some embedded viewers block it.":"Cluichí as baile, leithdháiltí agus dátaí crannchuir léite ó leathanach na dticéad as baile ar tickets.manutd.com ar 29 DFómh 2026; is iad dátaí an chic tosaigh as baile na cinn a roghnaíodh don teilifís agus d’fhéadfaidís bogadh fós. Cluichí baile, amanna an chic tosaigh agus infhaighteacht suíochán léite ó tickets.manutd.com ar 2 Samh 2026 (1 duine fásta, logáilte isteach mar Official Member); díoltar bloic amach agus scaoiltear iad, mar sin seiceáil roimh áirithint. Seiceáladh praghsanna eitiltí agus óstán ar SlickTrip ar 29 DFómh 2026 do 1 duine fásta agus beidh siad athraithe; is praghsanna “ó” iad táillí fillte a phéireálann an eitilt amach ainmnithe lena heitilt ar ais is saoire. Óstáin 4 réalta agus níos airde amháin (Hotel Football, teaghlach Marriott, óstáin ardchaighdeáin na cathrach agus iad siúd gar don staid); is don oíche chruinn den chluiche na praghsanna, an seomra is saoire, 1 duine fásta, agus taispeánann leathanach an óstáin féin an ráta beo agus gach díoltóir. Is í an aimsir réamhaisnéis Open-Meteo laistigh de 16 lá, nó meáin shéasúracha Mhanchain seachas sin. Faigheann leaganacha óstáilte den leathanach seo aimsir bheo; cuireann roinnt amharcán leabaithe bac air.","Bags larger than A4 (the prohibited items list gives 10x20x30cm) are not permitted and there is no bag storage at the stadium; medical exemptions must be arranged in advance via accessibility@nufc.co.uk and no exemption is given for travel or accommodation reasons. Banned items include glass, canned drinks, weapons, pyrotechnics, smoke canisters, air horns, lasers, drums, flag poles, prams and video recording equipment; all bags and people are searched.":"Ní cheadaítear málaí níos mó ná A4 (tugann liosta na n-earraí toirmiscthe 10x20x30cm) agus níl stóráil málaí ag an staid; caithfear díolúintí leighis a shocrú roimh ré trí accessibility@nufc.co.uk agus ní thugtar aon díolúine ar chúiseanna taistil ná lóistín. I measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá gloine, deochanna i gcannaí, airm, piteicnic, canna deataigh, adharca aeir, léasair, drumaí, cuaillí bratach, pramanna agus trealamh taifeadta físe; cuardaítear gach mála agus gach duine.","Bags must be no bigger than A4 and all bags are searched; the club advises not bringing one unless necessary. Banned items include alcohol, cans, glass and flasks, air horns, lasers, pyrotechnics, umbrellas, large bags or cabin bags, large-lens cameras, selfie sticks and flags over 2m x 1m (flags need a fire certificate and no poles). No bag storage is mentioned.":"Ní foláir nach mó málaí ná A4 agus cuardaítear gach mála; molann an club gan ceann a thabhairt leat mura gá. I measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá alcól, cannaí, gloine agus fleascanna, adharca aeir, léasair, piteicnic, scáthanna fearthainne, málaí móra nó málaí cábáin, ceamaraí le lionsaí móra, maidí féinphictiúr agus bratacha os cionn 2m x 1m (teastaíonn teastas dóiteáin ó bhratacha agus gan cuaillí). Ní luaitear stóráil málaí.","Bags up to A4 size (20cm x 30cm) are admitted after a search; there is no bag storage. Alcohol, bottles, cans, food, flagpoles, umbrellas, radios and footballs are banned; power banks are allowed; poleless flags up to 1m x 1m need a fire certificate. No alcohol is sold in general admission areas.":"Ligtear isteach málaí suas le méid A4 (20cm x 30cm) tar éis cuardaigh; níl stóráil málaí ann. Tá cosc ar alcól, buidéil, cannaí, bia, cuaillí bratach, scáthanna fearthainne, raidiónna agus liathróidí; ceadaítear bainc chumhachta; teastaíonn teastas dóiteáin do bhratacha gan cuaille suas le 1m x 1m. Ní dhíoltar alcól sna limistéir iontrála ginearálta.","Brentford strongly recommend not bringing a bag; maximum size is 34cm x 24cm x 11cm, measured by stewards, with no folding to fit. Oversized bags, suitcases, prams and buggies can only be stored at the Bees Superstore (opens 2 hours before kick-off), £5 per item or £10 for the largest bags and suitcases, and must be collected by the time on your storage ticket. Prohibited items include alcohol, cans, glass or dark plastic bottles, water over 500ml, laptops and tablets, large cameras, air horns, flares and poles; small folding umbrellas and flags up to 2m x 1m are allowed.":"Molann Brentford go láidir gan mála a thabhairt leat; is é 34cm x 24cm x 11cm an t-uasmhéid, arna thomhas ag na maoir, gan fillteadh chun é a chur in oiriúint. Ní féidir málaí rómhóra, cásanna taistil, pramanna ná bugaithe a stóráil ach ag an Bees Superstore (osclaíonn 2 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh), £5 an earra nó £10 do na málaí agus na cásanna is mó, agus caithfear iad a bhailiú faoin am ar do thicéad stórála. I measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá alcól, cannaí, gloine nó buidéil phlaisteacha dhorcha, uisce os cionn 500ml, ríomhairí glúine agus táibléid, ceamaraí móra, adharca aeir, bladhmanna agus cuaillí; ceadaítear scáthanna fearthainne beaga infhillte agus bratacha suas le 2m x 1m.","Busby's fifth and last title, unbeaten at home all season and sealed with a 6–1 win at West Ham on the penultimate Saturday. It put United back into the European Cup, which is what the season was really for. Alex Stepney, signed from Chelsea in September for £55,000, was the final piece.":"An cúigiú teideal agus an teideal deireanach ag Busby, gan chailleadh sa bhaile an séasúr ar fad agus séalaithe le bua 6–1 ag West Ham an Satharn roimh an deireadh. Chuir sé United ar ais i gCorn na hEorpa, agus ba é sin fíorchuspóir an tséasúir. Ba é Alex Stepney, sínithe ó Chelsea i Meán Fómhair ar £55,000, an píosa deireanach.","Busby's first trophy, three years after he took the job, and still playing home games at Maine Road while Old Trafford was rebuilt after the bombing. Every round was drawn away or at a neutral ground, with 3–0 wins over Aston Villa (after 6–4 in the third round), Liverpool, Charlton, Preston and Derby. The final against Blackpool is still spoken of as one of Wembley's best: 2–1 down with twenty minutes left, United scored three.":"An chéad chorn ag Busby, trí bliana tar éis dó an post a ghlacadh, agus cluichí baile fós á n-imirt ag Maine Road fad a bhí Old Trafford á atógáil tar éis an bhuamála. Tarraingíodh gach babhta as baile nó ag páirc neodrach, le buanna 3–0 ar Aston Villa (tar éis 6–4 sa tríú babhta), Liverpool, Charlton, Preston agus Derby. Labhraítear fós ar an gcluiche ceannais in aghaidh Blackpool mar cheann de na cinn is fearr ag Wembley: 2–1 síos le fiche nóiméad fágtha, scóráil United trí cinn.","Carry photo ID (passport) with your ticket; checks happen at police cordons and turnstiles. Gates open 90 minutes to two hours before kick-off; arrive early for the security checks. Tickets are print-at-home, personal and non-transferable, sent about five days before the match; do not book travel until you have one, as kick-off times can change.":"Bíodh aitheantas grianghrafach (pas) agat le do thicéad; déantar seiceálacha ag cordúin na bpóilíní agus ag na geataí casta. Osclaíonn na geataí 90 nóiméad go dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh; tar go luath do na seiceálacha slándála. Is ticéid le priontáil sa bhaile iad, pearsanta agus neamh-inaistrithe, seolta thart ar chúig lá roimh an gcluiche; ná cuir taisteal in áirithe go dtí go mbíonn ceann agat, mar d’fhéadfadh amanna an chic tosaigh athrú.","Champions League quarter-final, second leg, Old Trafford. Van Nistelrooy 43, Helguera 52 (og), Beckham 71, 85; Ronaldo 12, 50, 59. Out of Europe, but the night Ronaldo was applauded off by Old Trafford and Beckham scored twice from the bench. Included because the season is unexplained without it. Ronaldo's hat-trick and a standing ovation from the Stretford End; Beckham off the bench with two. Won the night, lost the tie 5–6.":"Cluiche ceathrú ceannais Shraith na Seaimpíní, an dara cos, Old Trafford. Van Nistelrooy 43, Helguera 52 (f.c.), Beckham 71, 85; Ronaldo 12, 50, 59. Amuigh as an Eoraip, ach an oíche ar thug Old Trafford bualadh bos do Ronaldo agus é ag imeacht den pháirc agus a scóráil Beckham faoi dhó ón mbinse. San áireamh mar nach féidir an séasúr a mhíniú gan é. Haitric Ronaldo agus bualadh bos ina seasamh ón Stretford End; Beckham ón mbinse le dhá chúl. Bua na hoíche, ach cailleadh an comhrac 5–6.","Champions League semi-final, second leg, Stadio delle Alpi. Keane 24, Yorke 34, Cole 83; Inzaghi 6, 11. Two down after eleven minutes. Keane's header, then his booking for a foul on Zidane. Inzaghi twice inside 11 minutes. Keane's header, Yorke's diving header and Cole's late winner, with Keane booked and out of the final — the night Ferguson called the most courageous performance he had seen.":"Cluiche leathcheannais Shraith na Seaimpíní, an dara cos, Stadio delle Alpi. Keane 24, Yorke 34, Cole 83; Inzaghi 6, 11. Dhá chúl síos tar éis aon nóiméad déag. Cúl ceann Keane, ansin a chárta buí as calaois ar Zidane. Inzaghi faoi dhó laistigh de 11 nóiméad. Cúl ceann Keane, cúl ceann tumtha Yorke agus cúl an bhua déanach ó Cole, le cárta buí do Keane agus é as an gcluiche ceannais — an oíche ar thug Ferguson an taispeántas ba mhisniúla dá bhfaca sé air.","Click a year above for the full season: every trophy that year, the decisive matches with scorers and line-ups, and — from 2010 — statistics and events from the match data. Highlight links open the club's official YouTube channel search.":"Cliceáil ar bhliain thuas don séasúr iomlán: gach corn an bhliain sin, na cluichí cinniúnacha le scórálaithe agus foirne, agus — ó 2010 — staitisticí agus imeachtaí ó shonraí an chluiche. Osclaíonn naisc na mbuaicphointí cuardach ar chainéal oifigiúil YouTube an chlub.","Club profile from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Head-to-head figures cover every competitive meeting: league and FA Cup from the match archive, League Cup, European and other cup ties from the Wikipedia season articles (1956/57 on, CC BY-SA 4.0), and the live feed from 2021/22 for cups and 2025/26 for everything. Wartime and friendly matches are not included.":"Próifíl an chlub ó Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Clúdaíonn figiúirí ceann ar cheann gach cluiche iomaíoch: an tsraith agus an FA Cup ó chartlann na gcluichí, Corn na Sraithe, cluichí Eorpacha agus cluichí corn eile ó ailt séasúir Wikipedia (1956/57 ar aghaidh, CC BY-SA 4.0), agus an fotha beo ó 2021/22 do chomórtais chorn agus ó 2025/26 do gach rud. Níl cluichí aimsir an chogaidh ná cluichí cairdiúla san áireamh.","Cristiano Ronaldo's first season and first trophy. Arsenal went the league unbeaten, but United knocked them out of the FA Cup in the semi-final at Villa Park with Scholes's goal, then beat Millwall 3–0 in the first final in Cardiff. Ronaldo, 19, headed the first; Van Nistelrooy scored a penalty and a second. Rio Ferdinand began an eight-month ban in January for a missed drugs test.":"An chéad séasúr agus an chéad chorn ag Cristiano Ronaldo. Níor chaill Arsenal sa tsraith, ach chuir United amach as an FA Cup iad sa chluiche leathcheannais ag Villa Park le cúl Scholes, ansin bhuaigh siad 3–0 ar Millwall sa chéad chluiche ceannais i gCaerdydd. Chuir Ronaldo, 19, an chéad cheann lena cheann; scóráil Van Nistelrooy cic éirice agus an dara ceann. Thosaigh Rio Ferdinand cosc ocht mí in Eanáir as tástáil drugaí a chailleadh.","Each match links to the site's match centre (events and line-ups, 2010/11 on) and to the report the Wikipedia season article cites — BBC or manutd.com for most games since 1999 — or, before that, to the season article itself.":"Nascann gach cluiche le lárionad an chluiche ar an suíomh (imeachtaí agus foirne, 2010/11 ar aghaidh) agus leis an tuairisc a luann alt séasúir Wikipedia — BBC nó manutd.com don chuid is mó de na cluichí ó 1999 — nó, roimhe sin, leis an alt séasúir féin.","Eight points behind Arsenal at the start of March, champions by five. Van Nistelrooy scored in ten consecutive league games at the end of the season and 44 in all; Ferguson had been due to retire the previous summer and changed his mind. The turning point was Arsenal's 2–2 draw at Bolton on 26 April and their loss to Leeds a week later; Beckham played his last United game in the final match and left for Real Madrid that summer.":"Ocht bpointe taobh thiar de Arsenal ag tús mhí an Mhárta, seaimpíní le cúig phointe. Scóráil Van Nistelrooy i ndeich gcluiche sraithe as a chéile ag deireadh an tséasúir agus 44 san iomlán; bhí Ferguson le héirí as an samhradh roimhe sin agus d’athraigh sé a intinn. Ba é an pointe casaidh comhscór 2–2 Arsenal ag Bolton ar an 26 Aibreán agus a mbriseadh in aghaidh Leeds seachtain ina dhiaidh sin; d’imir Beckham a chluiche deireanach le United sa chluiche deireanach agus d’imigh sé go Real Madrid an samhradh sin.","English clubs were back in Europe after the five-year ban and United won the Cup Winners' Cup at the first attempt, beating Pécsi Munkás, Wrexham, Montpellier and Legia Warsaw, then Johan Cruyff's Barcelona in Rotterdam. Hughes, sold by Barcelona five years earlier, scored both. Lee Sharpe, 19, was PFA Young Player of the Year; the League Cup final was lost to Sheffield Wednesday.":"Bhí clubanna Sasanacha ar ais san Eoraip tar éis an choisc cúig bliana agus bhuaigh United Corn Bhuaiteoirí na gCorn ar an gcéad iarracht, ag buachan ar Pécsi Munkás, Wrexham, Montpellier agus Legia Warsaw, ansin ar Barcelona Johan Cruyff in Rotterdam. Scóráil Hughes, a dhíol Barcelona cúig bliana roimhe sin, an dá cheann. Ba é Lee Sharpe, 19, Imreoir Óg na Bliana PFA; cailleadh cluiche ceannais Chorn na Sraithe in aghaidh Sheffield Wednesday.","European Cup semi-final, second leg, Bernabéu. Sadler 73, Foulkes 78; Pirri 32, Gento 41, Amancio 45 (Zoco og 42). 3–1 down on the night at half-time, 3–2 behind on aggregate; Busby told them they were only one goal away.":"Cluiche leathcheannais Chorn na hEorpa, an dara cos, Bernabéu. Sadler 73, Foulkes 78; Pirri 32, Gento 41, Amancio 45 (Zoco f.c. 42). 3–1 síos ar an oíche ag leath-am, 3–2 taobh thiar ar an gcomhiomlán; dúirt Busby leo nach raibh siad ach cúl amháin ar shiúl.","Event data from API-Football; classics from the club's records. \"Two goals down\" means United trailed by two or more and did not lose; \"injury-time winner\" is a winning goal in stoppage time; \"ten men\" is a United red card before the 75th minute in a match not lost.":"Sonraí imeachtaí ó API-Football; na seanchluichí móra ó thaifid an chlub. Ciallaíonn “Dhá chúl síos” go raibh United dhá chúl nó níos mó taobh thiar agus nár chaill siad; is cúl buach san am cúitimh é “cúl an bhua san am cúitimh”; is é “deichniúr” cárta dearg do United roimh an 75ú nóiméad i gcluiche nár cailleadh.","Every away ground on this season's list. Each guide is written from the host club's own supporter pages and one away-travel source, with the date it was last checked shown on the guide — clubs change bag rules and turnstiles, so check the date before you rely on it.":"Gach staid as baile ar liosta an tséasúir seo. Scríobhtar gach treoir ó leathanaigh lucht leanúna an chlub óstaigh féin agus ó fhoinse taistil as baile amháin, agus an dáta ar seiceáladh í go deireanach ar an treoir — athraíonn clubanna rialacha málaí agus geataí casta, mar sin seiceáil an dáta sula mbraitheann tú air.","Everyone whose first appearance in a United squad list came in one of his seasons, from the squad-number records (1994/95 on). Signings and academy graduates both appear; a player who arrived mid-season under a successor will show against the manager who started that season.":"Gach duine ar tháinig a chéad láithriú ar liosta scuaid United i gceann dá shéasúir, ó thaifid uimhreacha an scuaid (1994/95 ar aghaidh). Tá síniúcháin agus céimithe an acadaimh araon ann; taispeánfar imreoir a tháinig i lár séasúir faoi chomharba in aghaidh an bhainisteora a thosaigh an séasúr sin.","Everything on this page is computed from the match archive: league and FA Cup from engsoccerdata, League Cup, European and other cup ties from the Wikipedia season articles (CC BY-SA 4.0), and the live feed for recent seasons. No wartime, friendly or pre-League games, so the archive begins with Newton Heath's first League season, 1892/93.":"Ríomhtar gach rud ar an leathanach seo ó chartlann na gcluichí: an tsraith agus an FA Cup ó engsoccerdata, Corn na Sraithe, cluichí Eorpacha agus cluichí corn eile ó ailt séasúir Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0), agus an fotha beo do na séasúir le déanaí. Gan cluichí aimsir an chogaidh, cairdiúla ná roimh an tSraith, mar sin tosaíonn an chartlann le chéad séasúr sraithe Newton Heath, 1892/93.","FA Cup semi-final replay, Maine Road. Irwin, Kanchelskis, Robson, Giggs; Pointon. Three days after Hughes's volley in the 119th minute had saved the first match at Wembley. Pointon put Oldham ahead in extra time; Hughes' volley with a minute of it left kept the Double alive. United won the replay 4–1.":"Athimirt chluiche leathcheannais an FA Cup, Maine Road. Irwin, Kanchelskis, Robson, Giggs; Pointon. Trí lá tar éis do volaí Hughes sa 119ú nóiméad an chéad chluiche ag Wembley a shábháil. Chuir Pointon Oldham chun tosaigh san am breise; choinnigh volaí Hughes, le nóiméad de fágtha, an Dúbailt beo. Bhuaigh United an athimirt 4–1.","FA Cup semi-final replay, Villa Park. Beckham 17, Giggs 109; Bergkamp 69. Keane sent off, Schmeichel saved Bergkamp's penalty in the last minute, then Giggs took the ball from Vieira in his own half and beat five players. Beckham's opener, Bergkamp's equaliser, Keane sent off, Schmeichel saves Bergkamp's last-minute penalty, then Giggs runs through half the Arsenal defence in extra time.":"Athimirt chluiche leathcheannais an FA Cup, Villa Park. Beckham 17, Giggs 109; Bergkamp 69. Keane curtha den pháirc, shábháil Schmeichel cic éirice Bergkamp sa nóiméad deireanach, ansin thóg Giggs an liathróid ó Vieira ina leath féin agus chuaigh sé thar chúigear imreoirí. Cúl tosaigh Beckham, cúl cothromaithe Bergkamp, Keane curtha den pháirc, Schmeichel ag sábháil cic éirice Bergkamp sa nóiméad deireanach, ansin ritheann Giggs trí leath chosaint Arsenal san am breise.","Falmer station queues can take up to 50 minutes to clear and buses fill fast; the South Stand concourse stays open for an hour after the match and the North Stand bar is open to both sets of fans, so waiting is an option. Park & Ride buses run back up to 90 minutes after the game. Free rail travel covers journeys started within 3.5 hours of the final whistle; last-train times to London or Manchester: not stated.":"D’fhéadfadh sé suas le 50 nóiméad a thógáil scuainí stáisiún Falmer a ghlanadh agus líonann busanna go tapa; fanann halla an South Stand ar oscailt ar feadh uair an chloig tar éis an chluiche agus tá beár an North Stand ar oscailt don dá dhream lucht leanúna, mar sin is rogha é fanacht. Ritheann busanna Park & Ride ar ais suas le 90 nóiméad tar éis an chluiche. Clúdaíonn taisteal iarnróid saor in aisce turais a thosaítear laistigh de 3.5 uair an chloig ón bhfeadóg dheiridh; amanna na traenach deireanaí go Londain nó go Manchain: níl siad luaite.","Ferguson's 13th title and his last, a year after the Agüero goal had taken the 2012 championship on goal difference. Van Persie, 29, signed from Arsenal for £24m, scored 26 and won the Golden Boot; the title was clinched with four games left on 22 April with his hat-trick against Aston Villa, the second a volley from Rooney's long pass. Ferguson announced his retirement on 8 May; his last match was a 5–5 at West Brom.":"An 13ú teideal ag Ferguson agus an ceann deireanach, bliain tar éis do chúl Agüero craobh 2012 a thógáil ar dhifríocht chúl. Scóráil Van Persie, 29, sínithe ó Arsenal ar £24m, 26 agus bhuaigh sé an Bhróg Órga; baineadh an teideal amach le ceithre chluiche fágtha ar an 22 Aibreán lena haitric in aghaidh Aston Villa, an dara ceann ina volaí ó phas fada Rooney. D’fhógair Ferguson go raibh sé ag éirí as ar an 8 Bealtaine; ba é a chluiche deireanach 5–5 ag West Brom.","Figures from API-Football via this site's Worker; the report rebuilds every six hours and archives one copy a week. Academy games (U18 / U21 / youth cups) are not in the feed, so a player only appears here once he is in a first-team squad or out on loan.":"Figiúirí ó API-Football trí Worker an tsuímh seo; atógtar an tuarascáil gach sé huaire an chloig agus cartlannaítear cóip amháin in aghaidh na seachtaine. Níl cluichí acadaimh (U18 / U21 / cornanna óige) san fhotha, mar sin ní bhíonn imreoir anseo go dtí go mbíonn sé i scuad den chéad fhoireann nó amuigh ar iasacht.","Finals line-ups from the Wikipedia match articles (CC BY-SA 4.0). Season figures from the Wikipedia season articles (CC BY-SA 4.0), all competitions; the current season is live from API-Football. Where two players share a number in one season (a transfer), both are listed.":"Foirne na gcluichí ceannais ó ailt chluichí Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0). Figiúirí séasúir ó ailt séasúir Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0), gach comórtas; tá an séasúr reatha beo ó API-Football. Nuair a roinneann beirt imreoirí uimhir in aon séasúr amháin (aistriú), liostaítear an bheirt.","Five years after Munich, the first trophy of the rebuilt side — and in a season the league form nearly took United down. Law, bought from Torino for a British record £115,000, scored in the final against Leicester, who had finished fourth and were favourites. David Herd got the other two. It was the beginning of the Law–Charlton–Best side; Best made his debut that September.":"Cúig bliana tar éis München, an chéad chorn ag an bhfoireann atógtha — agus i séasúr a raibh foirm na sraithe beagnach ag cur United síos. Scóráil Law, a ceannaíodh ó Torino ar thaifead Briotanach £115,000, sa chluiche ceannais in aghaidh Leicester, a chríochnaigh sa cheathrú háit agus a bhí ina rogha na coitiantachta. Fuair David Herd an dá cheann eile. Ba é tús fhoireann Law–Charlton–Best é; d’imir Best a chéad chluiche an Meán Fómhair sin.","Fixture dates from tickets.manutd.com (home) and the TV-selected lists (away) on 29 Oct 2026. Live table, results and form from API-Football via this site's own Worker; nothing is fetched from the user's browser except this site and flag images.":"Dátaí na gcluichí ó tickets.manutd.com (baile) agus ó na liostaí a roghnaíodh don teilifís (as baile) ar 29 DFómh 2026. Tábla beo, torthaí agus foirm ó API-Football trí Worker an tsuímh seo féin; ní fhaightear aon rud ó bhrabhsálaí an úsáideora ach an suíomh seo agus íomhánna bratach.","Four stations serve the ground: White Hart Lane (Overground from Liverpool Street, about 5 minutes' walk), Northumberland Park (Greater Anglia from Liverpool Street and Stratford, about 10 minutes, and the station the club steers away fans towards; the away entrances are on Worcester Avenue via Park Lane), Tottenham Hale (Victoria line plus Greater Anglia, about 25 minutes) and Seven Sisters (Victoria line and Overground, about 30 minutes, no step-free access). The Victoria line is very crowded before weeknight games and trains sometimes skip Seven Sisters. Buses 149, 249, 279 and 349 run up the High Road, though routes are diverted by road closures. Taxis cannot drop off near the stadium; arrange a point at least 15 minutes' walk away.":"Freastalaíonn ceithre stáisiún ar an staid: White Hart Lane (Overground ó Liverpool Street, thart ar 5 nóiméad siúil), Northumberland Park (Greater Anglia ó Liverpool Street agus Stratford, thart ar 10 nóiméad, agus an stáisiún a dtreoraíonn an club lucht leanúna as baile chuige; tá bealaí isteach na gcuairteoirí ar Worcester Avenue trí Park Lane), Tottenham Hale (líne Victoria móide Greater Anglia, thart ar 25 nóiméad) agus Seven Sisters (líne Victoria agus Overground, thart ar 30 nóiméad, gan rochtain gan chéimeanna). Bíonn an líne Victoria an-phlódaithe roimh chluichí oícheanta seachtaine agus uaireanta ní stopann traenacha ag Seven Sisters. Ritheann busanna 149, 249, 279 agus 349 suas an High Road, cé go n-atreoraítear bealaí de bharr bóithre dúnta. Ní féidir le tacsaithe daoine a fhágáil gar don staid; socraigh pointe 15 nóiméad siúil ar shiúl ar a laghad.","Four times runners-up in five years, Busby's first great side finally took the title in Carey's last season. It came down to the final day against Arsenal at Old Trafford, who needed to win 7–0 to overhaul United's goal average; United won 6–1. Rowley scored a hat-trick and finished with 30 league goals. Roger Byrne, 22, played the run-in at outside-left — the first of the Babes.":"Sa dara háit ceithre huaire i gcúig bliana, bhain an chéad fhoireann mhór ag Busby an teideal faoi dheireadh i séasúr deireanach Carey. Tháinig sé síos go dtí an lá deiridh in aghaidh Arsenal ag Old Trafford, a raibh orthu buachan 7–0 le dul thar mheán cúl United; bhuaigh United 6–1. Scóráil Rowley haitric agus chríochnaigh sé le 30 cúl sraithe. D’imir Roger Byrne, 22, an deireadh séasúir ar an eite chlé — an chéad duine de na Babes.","From 1939 to 1993 the shirt went with the position: 1 goalkeeper, 2 and 3 full-backs, 4–6 half-backs, 7–11 forwards. Nobody owned a number, so the record is match by match, from the line-ups in Wikipedia's article on each final.":"Ó 1939 go 1993 bhain an geansaí leis an ionad: 1 cúl báire, 2 agus 3 lánchúlaithe, 4–6 leathchúlaithe, 7–11 tosaithe. Ní raibh uimhir ag aon duine, mar sin tá an taifead cluiche ar chluiche, ó na foirne in alt Wikipedia ar gach cluiche ceannais.","From Birmingham New Street take a local train (10-15 minutes, extra services on matchdays) to Witton, the nearest station to the away turnstiles - turn left out of the station, down to the roundabout, then left into Witton Lane for the away entrance a few minutes' walk away. Aston station is the alternative, about a 10-15 minute walk. Villa also run a matchday express city centre shuttle bus from Dudley Street (near New Street station) to Villa Park, open to home and away fans. Street parking around the ground is residents-only with £60 fines, and a traffic exclusion zone covers Witton Lane and Trinity Road from 2 hours before kick-off to 30-60 minutes after.":"Ó Birmingham New Street tóg traein áitiúil (10-15 nóiméad, seirbhísí breise ar laethanta cluiche) go Witton, an stáisiún is gaire do gheataí casta na gcuairteoirí - cas ar chlé amach as an stáisiún, síos go dtí an timpeallán, ansin ar chlé isteach i Witton Lane go dtí bealach isteach na gcuairteoirí cúpla nóiméad siúil ar shiúl. Is é stáisiún Aston an rogha eile, thart ar 10-15 nóiméad siúil. Ritheann Villa bus tointeála sainráite lae cluiche ó lár na cathrach ó Dudley Street (gar do stáisiún New Street) go Villa Park freisin, ar oscailt do lucht leanúna baile agus as baile. Is do chónaitheoirí amháin páirceáil sráide timpeall na staide le fíneálacha £60, agus clúdaíonn crios eisiaimh tráchta Witton Lane agus Trinity Road ó 2 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh go 30-60 nóiméad ina dhiaidh.","From Heathrow take the Piccadilly line direct to Arsenal (about 1 hour 10 minutes); from Gatwick take a train to Victoria then the Victoria line to Highbury & Islington (about 1 hour 15 minutes); from Luton or Stansted take a train to King's Cross St Pancras then the Piccadilly line to Arsenal (about 1 hour).":"Ó Heathrow tóg an líne Piccadilly díreach go Arsenal (thart ar 1 uair an chloig 10 nóiméad); ó Gatwick tóg traein go Victoria agus ansin an líne Victoria go Highbury & Islington (thart ar 1 uair an chloig 15 nóiméad); ó Luton nó Stansted tóg traein go King's Cross St Pancras agus ansin an líne Piccadilly go Arsenal (thart ar 1 uair an chloig).","From Liverpool Lime Street the ground is around two miles away; the club says a taxi from the city centre is usually £8-£10. The 917 Express bus runs from Commutation Row (near Lime Street) in about 15 minutes, and routes 26 (Liverpool ONE), 17 (Queen Square), 68/168, 14 and 19 also stop nearby; a matchday 926 service starts 3.5 hours before kick-off from Liverpool ONE. By Merseyrail, go to Sandhills and take the Soccerbus, which runs from 2 hours before kick-off. Kirkdale is the closest station (just under a mile); Stanley Park car park is permit holders only.":"Ó Liverpool Lime Street tá an staid thart ar dhá mhíle ar shiúl; deir an club gur £8-£10 a chosnaíonn tacsaí ó lár na cathrach de ghnáth. Ritheann bus 917 Express ó Commutation Row (gar do Lime Street) i thart ar 15 nóiméad, agus stopann bealaí 26 (Liverpool ONE), 17 (Queen Square), 68/168, 14 agus 19 in aice láimhe freisin; tosaíonn seirbhís 926 lae cluiche 3.5 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh ó Liverpool ONE. Le Merseyrail, téigh go Sandhills agus tóg an Soccerbus, a ritheann ó 2 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh. Is é Kirkdale an stáisiún is gaire (beagán faoi mhíle); is do shealbhóirí ceadúnais amháin carrchlós Stanley Park.","Fulham Broadway is very crowded after the game and its entrance has been closed at full time; wait a few minutes or walk to Earl's Court, West Kensington, West Brompton, Gloucester Road or South Kensington instead. Last train times to Manchester: not stated.":"Bíonn Fulham Broadway an-phlódaithe tar éis an chluiche agus dúnadh a bhealach isteach ag an lánam; fan cúpla nóiméad nó siúil go Earl's Court, West Kensington, West Brompton, Gloucester Road nó South Kensington ina ionad. Amanna na traenach deireanaí go Manchain: níl siad luaite.","Gatwick is the practical airport: a direct train runs to Norwood Junction, or a taxi of 30-40 minutes. From Heathrow, take the Heathrow Express or Piccadilly line into London and connect to Selhurst, Thornton Heath or Norwood Junction (taxi 45-60 minutes).":"Is é Gatwick an t-aerfort praiticiúil: ritheann traein dhíreach go Norwood Junction, nó tacsaí 30-40 nóiméad. Ó Heathrow, tóg an Heathrow Express nó an líne Piccadilly isteach go Londain agus déan ceangal le Selhurst, Thornton Heath nó Norwood Junction (tacsaí 45-60 nóiméad).","Holloway Road station is closed for up to two hours after the match, so use Arsenal, Finsbury Park or Highbury & Islington, all with managed post-match queuing. Arsenal station queues can mean a wait of at least 30 minutes, so consider walking to Finsbury Park; the club advises arriving early and leaving later to avoid crowds. Last trains to Manchester: not stated.":"Dúntar stáisiún Holloway Road ar feadh suas le dhá uair an chloig tar éis an chluiche, mar sin úsáid Arsenal, Finsbury Park nó Highbury & Islington, a bhfuil scuainí bainistithe tar éis an chluiche ag gach ceann acu. D’fhéadfadh scuainí stáisiún Arsenal fanacht 30 nóiméad ar a laghad a chiallú, mar sin smaoinigh ar shiúl go Finsbury Park; molann an club teacht go luath agus imeacht níos déanaí leis na sluaite a sheachaint. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain: níl siad luaite.","Kew Bridge is the nearest station (South Western Railway from London Waterloo, about every 15 minutes on matchday Saturdays, not step-free). Brentford station is the nearest step-free station, about 20 minutes' walk. Gunnersbury (District line and London Overground) is also close but has a small platform with restricted access at busy times; Kew Gardens, Chiswick Park, South Acton, Acton Town and South Ealing are other options - eight stations are within a 20-minute walk. Buses 65, 110, 237, 267, H91 and 391 serve the stadium. Taxis and Uber are available but expect longer waits after the match.":"Is é Kew Bridge an stáisiún is gaire (South Western Railway ó London Waterloo, thart ar gach 15 nóiméad ar Shathairn lae cluiche, gan a bheith gan chéimeanna). Is é stáisiún Brentford an stáisiún gan chéimeanna is gaire, thart ar 20 nóiméad siúil. Tá Gunnersbury (líne District agus London Overground) gar freisin ach tá ardán beag ann le rochtain shrianta ag amanna gnóthacha; is roghanna eile iad Kew Gardens, Chiswick Park, South Acton, Acton Town agus South Ealing - tá ocht stáisiún laistigh de 20 nóiméad siúil. Freastalaíonn busanna 65, 110, 237, 267, H91 agus 391 ar an staid. Tá tacsaithe agus Uber ar fáil ach bí ag súil le fanacht níos faide tar éis an chluiche.","Kit images from the site's own archive. Manufacturer and sponsor by season from the club's kit history. Players shown for a season are the most-used from the season squad records (1993–94 onwards) or the trophy-season write-ups.":"Íomhánna feistis ó chartlann an tsuímh féin. Déantóir agus urraitheoir de réir séasúir ó stair feistis an chlub. Is iad na himreoirí a thaispeántar do shéasúr na cinn ba mhó a úsáideadh de réir thaifid scuaid an tséasúir (1993–94 ar aghaidh) nó cuntais na séasúr le corn.","List of managers from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Records are competitive matches only (league, FA Cup, League Cup, Europe and other cups); wartime and pre-League games are not in the archive, which is why Albut, Busby and others fall short of the published totals shown in grey.":"Liosta bainisteoirí ó Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Cluichí iomaíocha amháin atá sna taifid (sraith, FA Cup, Corn na Sraithe, an Eoraip agus corn eile); níl cluichí aimsir an chogaidh ná cluichí roimh an tSraith sa chartlann, agus sin an fáth a bhfuil Albut, Busby agus daoine eile faoi bhun na n-iomlán foilsithe a thaispeántar i liath.","Liverpool John Lennon Airport: shuttle bus to Liverpool South Parkway, then Merseyrail Northern Line to Sandhills and the Soccerbus, or a taxi of 20-30 minutes depending on traffic. From Manchester Airport, take a direct train or coach to Liverpool city centre then bus or rail to Anfield.":"Liverpool John Lennon Airport: bus tointeála go Liverpool South Parkway, ansin Merseyrail Northern Line go Sandhills agus an Soccerbus, nó tacsaí 20-30 nóiméad ag brath ar an trácht. Ó Aerfort Mhanchain, tóg traein dhíreach nó cóiste go lár chathair Learpholl agus ansin bus nó traein go Anfield.","Mark shirts you own and ones you want from any shirt's page. A collection key (any phrase you'll remember, 6+ characters) saves it to this site privately so it follows you between devices; without one it stays in this browser only.":"Marcáil na geansaithe atá agat agus na cinn atá uait ó leathanach aon gheansaí. Sábhálann eochair bhailiúcháin (aon fhrása a chuimhneoidh tú, 6+ charachtar) go príobháideach ar an suíomh seo é ionas go leanann sé thú idir gléasanna; gan ceann, fanann sé sa bhrabhsálaí seo amháin.","Matches from the club archive (league, FA Cup, League Cup, Europe, Shields; friendlies and wartime leagues not included). Scorers from the season articles and, from 2025/26, the live feed; comeback tags from 2010 onwards. Weather, the kind of goal (volley, header) and who assisted are not recorded, so those words are ignored.":"Cluichí ó chartlann an chlub (sraith, FA Cup, Corn na Sraithe, an Eoraip, Sciatha; níl cluichí cairdiúla ná sraitheanna aimsir an chogaidh san áireamh). Scórálaithe ó ailt na séasúr agus, ó 2025/26, ón bhfotha beo; clibeanna teachta aniar ó 2010 ar aghaidh. Ní thaifeadtar an aimsir, an cineál cúil (volaí, cúl ceann) ná cé a thug an cúnamh, mar sin déantar neamhaird de na focail sin.","Mello Mello Bar (677 Christchurch Road, Boscombe) is on the walking route from Pokesdown and welcomes visiting fans; Football Ground Guide also lists the Bell Inn (915 Christchurch Road, Pokesdown) and The George Tapps (Old Christchurch Road, town centre). The 1910 Supporters Bar and Queens Park Hotel are home-only.":"Tá Mello Mello Bar (677 Christchurch Road, Boscombe) ar an mbealach siúil ó Pokesdown agus cuireann sé fáilte roimh lucht leanúna cuairte; liostaíonn Football Ground Guide freisin an Bell Inn (915 Christchurch Road, Pokesdown) agus The George Tapps (Old Christchurch Road, lár an bhaile). Is do lucht leanúna baile amháin an 1910 Supporters Bar agus Queens Park Hotel.","Metrolink tram from the city centre (Piccadilly, Victoria, Market Street, St Peter's Square or Piccadilly Gardens) to the Etihad Campus stop takes 10-15 minutes (about 8 minutes from Piccadilly), every six minutes Monday to Saturday; Etihad Campus is in Zone 2, contactless tap-in accepted. The club says the walk from the city centre is roughly 30 minutes along the signposted Citylink walking route from Piccadilly through Ancoats, New Islington and Holt Town (20-25 minutes via Great Ancoats Street, Pollard Street and Ashton New Road). Ashburys rail station is five minutes by train from Piccadilly then about a 20-minute walk. TfGM runs matchday bus routes from across Greater Manchester.":"Tógann tram Metrolink ó lár na cathrach (Piccadilly, Victoria, Market Street, St Peter's Square nó Piccadilly Gardens) go stad Etihad Campus 10-15 nóiméad (thart ar 8 nóiméad ó Piccadilly), gach sé nóiméad Luan go Satharn; tá Etihad Campus i gCrios 2, glactar le híocaíocht gan teagmháil. Deir an club gur thart ar 30 nóiméad an tsiúlóid ó lár na cathrach feadh bhealach siúil Citylink atá comharthaithe ó Piccadilly trí Ancoats, New Islington agus Holt Town (20-25 nóiméad trí Great Ancoats Street, Pollard Street agus Ashton New Road). Tá stáisiún iarnróid Ashburys cúig nóiméad ar an traein ó Piccadilly agus ansin thart ar 20 nóiméad siúil. Ritheann TfGM bealaí bus lae cluiche ó gach cearn de Greater Manchester.","Most pubs near the stadium are home-only with doormen. Football Ground Guide names the Antwerp Arms (Church Road, mixed home and away) and the brewery taprooms on the Compass Industrial Estate (Tottenham Brewing Co, Tariff Road; One Mile End, Redemption and Bohem on West Road), 5 to 10 minutes from the away turnstiles, and suggests drinking in central London, e.g. the Hamilton Hall Wetherspoon at Liverpool Street.":"Is do lucht leanúna baile amháin formhór na dtithe tábhairne gar don staid, le doirseoirí. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide an Antwerp Arms (Church Road, meascán de lucht leanúna baile agus as baile) agus seomraí blaiseadh na ngrúdlann ar an Compass Industrial Estate (Tottenham Brewing Co, Tariff Road; One Mile End, Redemption agus Bohem ar West Road), 5 go 10 nóiméad ó gheataí casta na gcuairteoirí, agus molann sé ól i lár Londan, m.sh. an Hamilton Hall Wetherspoon ag Liverpool Street.","Newcastle Central Station is a ten-minute walk: head west along Neville Street then turn right onto St James' Boulevard and the stadium is at the top. Monument Metro station is a five-minute walk and St James Metro station is right by the ground. Haymarket and Eldon Square bus stations are on Percy Street, five minutes away; the nearest taxi rank is two minutes away opposite the Chinatown entrance, with major ranks at Central Station. There is no public parking at the stadium; a Park and Ride (X50, £2 return) runs from the Metrocentre and drops off on Barrack Road.":"Tá Newcastle Central Station siúlóid deich nóiméad ar shiúl: téigh siar feadh Neville Street, ansin cas ar dheis ar St James' Boulevard agus tá an staid ag a bharr. Tá stáisiún Metro Monument cúig nóiméad siúil ar shiúl agus tá stáisiún Metro St James díreach in aice leis an staid. Tá stáisiúin bus Haymarket agus Eldon Square ar Percy Street, cúig nóiméad ar shiúl; tá an stad tacsaithe is gaire dhá nóiméad ar shiúl os comhair bhealach isteach Chinatown, le príomhstadanna ag Central Station. Níl páirceáil phoiblí ag an staid; ritheann Park and Ride (X50, £2 fillte) ón Metrocentre agus fágann sé daoine ar Barrack Road.","Newcastle International Airport has its own Metro station; the club guide says the Metro to the city centre (Haymarket, Monument or Central) takes about 25 minutes with trains up to every 12 minutes in daytime, and Monument is a five-minute walk from the ground.":"Tá stáisiún Metro féin ag Newcastle International Airport; deir treoir an chlub go dtógann an Metro go lár na cathrach (Haymarket, Monument nó Central) thart ar 25 nóiméad le traenacha suas le gach 12 nóiméad i rith an lae, agus tá Monument cúig nóiméad siúil ón staid.","No bags larger than A4 (21cm x 29.7cm); all fans and bags are searched, with pyro and drug dogs. A bag drop for larger bags, suitcases and motorcycle helmets operates outside the South East / Village Way entrance - the fee is quoted variously as £5 (Jan 2026) and £7.50 (Mar 2026), and one Oct 2025 guide said there was no bag storage, so check before travelling. Flags need pre-approval from the South Stand Manager and a fire safety certificate.":"Gan málaí níos mó ná A4 (21cm x 29.7cm); cuardaítear gach duine agus gach mála, le madraí piteicnice agus drugaí. Bíonn áit fhágála málaí do mhálaí níos mó, cásanna taistil agus clogaid ghluaisrothair lasmuigh de bhealach isteach South East / Village Way - luaitear an táille mar £5 (Ean 2026) agus £7.50 (Márta 2026), agus dúirt treoir amháin ó DFómh 2025 nach raibh stóráil málaí ann, mar sin seiceáil roimh thaisteal. Teastaíonn réamhcheadú ón South Stand Manager agus teastas sábháilteachta dóiteáin ó bhratacha.","No bags larger than A4 are permitted and there are no facilities to leave bags at the stadium (Football Ground Guide quotes a maximum of 30 x 20 x 10 cm and mentions an external paid storage option in Alderman Park). Musical instruments and selfie sticks are banned in the away end; flags need a fire certificate.":"Ní cheadaítear málaí níos mó ná A4 agus níl áiseanna ann le málaí a fhágáil ag an staid (luann Football Ground Guide uasmhéid 30 x 20 x 10 cm agus luann sé rogha stórála sheachtrach íoctha in Alderman Park). Tá cosc ar uirlisí ceoil agus maidí féinphictiúr i gceann na gcuairteoirí; teastaíonn teastas dóiteáin ó bhratacha.","No formal size limit is published. Spanish law (Law 19/2007, cited by the club) bans weapons, flares, fireworks, flammable or smoke-producing items and offensive banners; 2021 advice to United fans also barred alcohol, cans, glass, bottle tops and containers over 0.5 litres. No bag storage is mentioned at the ground.":"Níl aon teorainn mhéide fhoirmiúil foilsithe. Cuireann dlí na Spáinne (Dlí 19/2007, a luann an club) cosc ar airm, bladhmanna, tinte ealaíne, earraí inadhainte nó a dhéanann deatach agus meirgí maslacha; chuir comhairle 2021 do lucht leanúna United cosc freisin ar alcól, cannaí, gloine, barr buidéal agus coimeádáin os cionn 0.5 lítear. Ní luaitear stóráil málaí ag an staid.","No league football 1915–19 and 1939–46 (wartime regional competitions are not counted). FA Cup rounds from the match records to 2018/19 and from the live feed after that. League tables are computed from every result with the points rules of the day.":"Ní raibh peil sraithe ann 1915–19 agus 1939–46 (ní chomhairtear comórtais réigiúnacha aimsir an chogaidh). Babhtaí an FA Cup ó thaifid na gcluichí go 2018/19 agus ón bhfotha beo ina dhiaidh sin. Ríomhtar táblaí sraithe ó gach toradh le rialacha pointí na linne.","No pubs near the Amex are open to away fans - the Falmer pub is home-only and checks tickets. Away fans generally drink around Brighton station or in central Brighton (Yates and Wetherspoons are the usual suggestions) or in Lewes; there is a small fan zone with mobile bars outside the north-east corner and the North Stand bar is open to both sets of fans after the match.":"Níl aon teach tábhairne gar don Amex ar oscailt do lucht leanúna as baile - is do lucht leanúna baile amháin teach tábhairne Falmer agus seiceálann sé ticéid. De ghnáth ólann lucht leanúna as baile timpeall stáisiún Brighton nó i lár Brighton (is iad Yates agus Wetherspoons na moltaí coitianta) nó i Lewes; tá crios beag lucht leanúna le beáir shoghluaiste lasmuigh den chúinne thoir thuaidh agus tá beár an North Stand ar oscailt don dá dhream lucht leanúna tar éis an chluiche.","Nottingham railway station is roughly a 20-minute walk (about 1.4 miles) or a 10-minute bus ride from the City Ground; from the city centre it is a brisk 15-20 minute walk - follow signs for Trent Bridge Cricket Ground, over the River Trent. Nottingham City Transport buses 5-11 drop closest to the ground but are heavily congested on matchdays. The nearest tram stop is Meadows Embankment, then a 20-minute walk. Taxi ranks are on Station Street and Queens Road at the front and rear of the station, or use Uber or Bolt.":"Tá stáisiún iarnróid Nottingham thart ar 20 nóiméad siúil (thart ar 1.4 míle) nó 10 nóiméad ar an mbus ón City Ground; ó lár na cathrach is siúlóid bhríomhar 15-20 nóiméad í - lean comharthaí do Trent Bridge Cricket Ground, thar an River Trent. Fágann busanna Nottingham City Transport 5-11 daoine is gaire don staid ach bíonn siad an-phlódaithe ar laethanta cluiche. Is é Meadows Embankment an stad tram is gaire, agus ansin siúlóid 20 nóiméad. Tá stadanna tacsaithe ar Station Street agus Queens Road ag tosach agus ag cúl an stáisiúin, nó úsáid Uber nó Bolt.","Only bags A4 size or smaller are allowed; large bags and suitcases are not permitted and all bags are searched and tagged, which slows entry. Arsenal points to luggage storage at London King's Cross station rather than offering any at the ground; flags and banners in the away end must be fire certificated.":"Ní cheadaítear ach málaí de mhéid A4 nó níos lú; ní cheadaítear málaí móra ná cásanna taistil agus cuardaítear agus clibeáiltear gach mála, rud a mhoillíonn an iontráil. Díríonn Arsenal ar stóráil bagáiste ag stáisiún London King's Cross seachas aon cheann a thairiscint ag an staid; ní foláir teastas dóiteáin a bheith ag bratacha agus meirgí i gceann na gcuairteoirí.","Only bags no larger than A4 (maximum 30cm x 20cm x 10cm) are allowed and all are searched; the club provides no bag storage but points to an independent matchday bag drop at Fulham Broadway Shopping Centre. Prohibited items include prams, large-lens cameras, glass, cans, plastic bottles over 500ml, aerosols, flag poles, umbrellas, selfie sticks, air horns and musical instruments; no smoking or vaping.":"Ní cheadaítear ach málaí nach mó ná A4 (uasmhéid 30cm x 20cm x 10cm) agus cuardaítear gach ceann; ní sholáthraíonn an club stóráil málaí ach díríonn sé ar áit fhágála málaí neamhspleách lae cluiche ag Fulham Broadway Shopping Centre. I measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá pramanna, ceamaraí le lionsaí móra, gloine, cannaí, buidéil phlaisteacha os cionn 500ml, aerasóil, cuaillí bratach, scáthanna fearthainne, maidí féinphictiúr, adharca aeir agus uirlisí ceoil; gan tobac ná vapáil.","Only small bags smaller than A4 (21cm x 29.7cm) are allowed; no large bags, suitcases, laptop bags or rucksacks, and Forest state they have nowhere to hold large bags and there is no bag drop. Clear plastic bottles up to 500ml, small compact cameras and small fold-up umbrellas are allowed; banned items include alcohol, cans and glass, food, face coverings, drones, poles and selfie sticks, musical instruments and video recording equipment. Banners need prior permission from Stadium Operations (0115 982 4444).":"Ní cheadaítear ach málaí beaga níos lú ná A4 (21cm x 29.7cm); gan málaí móra, cásanna taistil, málaí ríomhaire glúine ná málaí droma, agus deir Forest nach bhfuil áit acu le málaí móra a choinneáil agus níl áit fhágála málaí ann. Ceadaítear buidéil phlaisteacha ghlana suas le 500ml, ceamaraí beaga dlútha agus scáthanna fearthainne beaga infhillte; i measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá alcól, cannaí agus gloine, bia, clúdaigh aghaidhe, dróin, cuaillí agus maidí féinphictiúr, uirlisí ceoil agus trealamh taifeadta físe. Teastaíonn cead roimh ré ó Stadium Operations (0115 982 4444) do mheirgí.","Only small bags smaller than A4 are allowed; banned items include alcohol and canned drinks, glass and plastic bottles, sports bottles and flasks, laptops and tablets, large cameras, large umbrellas, poles, air horns, musical instruments, fireworks, flares and buggies. There is no left-luggage facility; for selected fixtures an advanced search bans coins, vapes, power banks and umbrellas, with a steward collection-ticket scheme for vapes, power banks and umbrellas only.":"Ní cheadaítear ach málaí beaga níos lú ná A4; i measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá alcól agus deochanna i gcannaí, buidéil ghloine agus phlaisteacha, buidéil spóirt agus fleascanna, ríomhairí glúine agus táibléid, ceamaraí móra, scáthanna fearthainne móra, cuaillí, adharca aeir, uirlisí ceoil, tinte ealaíne, bladhmanna agus bugaithe. Níl áis fhágála bagáiste ann; do chluichí roghnaithe cuireann cuardach réamhshocraithe cosc ar bhoinn, vapanna, bainc chumhachta agus scáthanna fearthainne, le scéim ticéad bailiúcháin ó na maoir do vapanna, bainc chumhachta agus scáthanna fearthainne amháin.","Only small handheld bags no larger than A4 (12 x 8 x 3 inches) are accepted; backpacks, holdalls and rucksacks are refused regardless of size, and pyrotechnics and smoke bombs are banned. There are no lockers, but a bag drop operates in the Grey car park inside the away compound at £10 per item.":"Ní ghlactar ach le málaí beaga láimhe nach mó ná A4 (12 x 8 x 3 orlach); diúltaítear málaí droma agus málaí móra cibé méid atá iontu, agus tá cosc ar phiteicnic agus buamaí deataigh. Níl taisceadáin ann, ach bíonn áit fhágála málaí sa Grey car park laistigh de chlós na gcuairteoirí ar £10 an earra.","Only small handheld bags no larger than A5 (148.5 x 210mm) are allowed and all bags get a visual search; larger bags are only permitted for medication or medical equipment with prior approval via disability@liverpoolfc.com at least 48 hours before the game. Banned items include cans, flasks, glass, plastic bottles over 500ml, laptops or tablets, drones, selfie sticks, flares, tools, weapons, laser devices, musical instruments and loud hailers; no bag storage is offered by the club.":"Ní cheadaítear ach málaí beaga láimhe nach mó ná A5 (148.5 x 210mm) agus cuardaítear gach mála le súil; ní cheadaítear málaí níos mó ach le haghaidh cógas nó trealamh leighis le cead roimh ré trí disability@liverpoolfc.com 48 uair an chloig ar a laghad roimh an gcluiche. I measc na n-earraí toirmiscthe tá cannaí, fleascanna, gloine, buidéil phlaisteacha os cionn 500ml, ríomhairí glúine nó táibléid, dróin, maidí féinphictiúr, bladhmanna, uirlisí, airm, gléasanna léasair, uirlisí ceoil agus callairí láimhe; ní thairgeann an club stóráil málaí.","Pick a fixture and a shape. The whole first-team squad is offered (players out on loan are not listed); anyone injured, suspended or doubtful is marked in the list and sorted to the bottom. Each player can be used once. Your XI is saved in this browser per fixture.":"Roghnaigh cluiche agus leagan amach. Tairgtear an scuad iomlán den chéad fhoireann (níl imreoirí atá ar iasacht liostaithe); marcáiltear aon duine atá gortaithe, ar fionraí nó in amhras sa liosta agus sórtáiltear go bun é. Is féidir gach imreoir a úsáid uair amháin. Sábháiltear d’fhoireann sa bhrabhsálaí seo do gach cluiche.","Players, seasons, opponents, managers, records, this season. The answer is written by Claude from the data on this site only — the archive built from Wikipedia's season tables and squad lists, plus the live feed — and it links the pages it used. If the site doesn't hold it, it says so.":"Imreoirí, séasúir, céilí comhraic, bainisteoirí, taifid, an séasúr seo. Scríobhann Claude an freagra ó na sonraí ar an suíomh seo amháin — an chartlann a tógadh ó tháblaí séasúir agus liostaí scuaid Wikipedia, chomh maith leis an bhfotha beo — agus cuireann sé naisc leis na leathanaigh a d’úsáid sé. Mura bhfuil sé ag an suíomh, deir sé é sin.","Pokesdown for Boscombe is the nearest station, about a 15-minute walk (turn right onto Christchurch Road, then right into Gloucester Road); Pokesdown is not currently wheelchair accessible. Bournemouth (Central) station is a 25 to 30-minute walk: leave by the south exit, turn left to Holdenhurst Road, follow it to the Queens Park roundabout and turn right into Kings Park Drive. Yellow Buses No. 33 runs from outside Bournemouth station south exit (ask for Kings Park Drive), or take a taxi from either station. The club discourages driving: from 2026/27 there is no general admission parking in the Kings Park car parks and the council enforces local restrictions on matchdays.":"Is é Pokesdown for Boscombe an stáisiún is gaire, thart ar 15 nóiméad siúil (cas ar dheis ar Christchurch Road, ansin ar dheis isteach i Gloucester Road); níl Pokesdown inrochtana do chathaoireacha rothaí faoi láthair. Tá stáisiún Bournemouth (Central) 25 go 30 nóiméad siúil ar shiúl: fág tríd an slí amach theas, cas ar chlé go Holdenhurst Road, lean é go dtí timpeallán Queens Park agus cas ar dheis isteach i Kings Park Drive. Ritheann Yellow Buses Uimh. 33 ó lasmuigh de shlí amach theas stáisiún Bournemouth (iarr Kings Park Drive), nó tóg tacsaí ó cheachtar stáisiún. Molann an club gan tiomáint: ó 2026/27 níl páirceáil iontrála ginearálta i gcarrchlóis Kings Park agus cuireann an chomhairle srianta áitiúla i bhfeidhm ar laethanta cluiche.","Post-match queuing systems run at all four stations; follow signage and stewards. Trains at Northumberland Park are split into northbound and southbound queues and the station gets very congested; some fans walk to Seven Sisters or Tottenham Hale for the Victoria line. Last train times: not stated; use the toilets inside the ground as there are none at the local stations.":"Bíonn córais scuaine tar éis an chluiche ag na ceithre stáisiún; lean na comharthaí agus na maoir. Roinntear traenacha ag Northumberland Park ina scuainí ó thuaidh agus ó dheas agus éiríonn an stáisiún an-phlódaithe; siúlann roinnt lucht leanúna go Seven Sisters nó Tottenham Hale don líne Victoria. Amanna na traenach deireanaí: níl siad luaite; úsáid na leithris laistigh den staid mar níl aon cheann ag na stáisiúin áitiúla.","Premier League, Old Trafford. Bruce 86, 90+6; Hirst 65 (pen). Referee Michael Peck pulled a muscle and linesman John Hilditch took over, which is why seven minutes were added. 'Fergie time' was born here. A penalty down with the title slipping, then Bruce's header in the 86th and another seven minutes into stoppage time — Ferguson and Kidd on the pitch, and the first title in 26 years within reach.":"Premier League, Old Trafford. Bruce 86, 90+6; Hirst 65 (c.é.). Stróic an réiteoir Michael Peck matán agus ghlac an maor líne John Hilditch an áit, agus sin an fáth ar cuireadh seacht nóiméad leis. Rugadh ‘Fergie time’ anseo. Cic éirice síos agus an teideal ag sleamhnú, ansin cúl ceann Bruce sa 86ú nóiméad agus ceann eile seacht nóiméad isteach san am cúitimh — Ferguson agus Kidd ar an bpáirc, agus an chéad teideal le 26 bliain faoi ghreim.","Premier League, Old Trafford. Keane 36, G. Neville 42, Solskjær 68; Juninho 15, Emerson 50, Hignett 61 (pen). The point that left Liverpool needing to win at Wimbledon the next night. They lost, Newcastle drew, and the title was United's.":"Premier League, Old Trafford. Keane 36, G. Neville 42, Solskjær 68; Juninho 15, Emerson 50, Hignett 61 (c.é.). An pointe a d’fhág go raibh ar Liverpool buachan ag Wimbledon an oíche dár gcionn. Chaill siad, chríochnaigh Newcastle cothrom, agus ba le United an teideal.","Profile and list of managers from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Records are computed from the match archive (league and FA Cup), the Wikipedia season articles (League Cup, Europe and other cups from 1956/57) and the live feed; wartime and pre-League games are not included, which is why some totals fall short of the published figure.":"Próifíl agus liosta bainisteoirí ó Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Ríomhtar taifid ó chartlann na gcluichí (sraith agus FA Cup), ó ailt séasúir Wikipedia (Corn na Sraithe, an Eoraip agus corn eile ó 1956/57) agus ón bhfotha beo; níl cluichí aimsir an chogaidh ná roimh an tSraith san áireamh, agus sin an fáth a bhfuil roinnt iomlán faoi bhun an fhigiúir fhoilsithe.","Pubs around the ground generally welcome both home and away fans. Brentford name The Gunnersbury and The Pilot near Gunnersbury station, Express Tavern, One Over the Ait, The Bell & Crown, The Steam Packet and City Barge closest to the stadium, and The Rose and Crown, The Greyhound, The Coach & Horses and The Botanist on Kew Green. Fulham Supporters Trust (Apr 2026) describe The Gunnersbury (590 Chiswick High Road) as the designated away pub and suggest booking.":"Cuireann na tithe tábhairne timpeall na staide fáilte roimh lucht leanúna baile agus as baile de ghnáth. Ainmníonn Brentford The Gunnersbury agus The Pilot gar do stáisiún Gunnersbury, Express Tavern, One Over the Ait, The Bell & Crown, The Steam Packet agus City Barge is gaire don staid, agus The Rose and Crown, The Greyhound, The Coach & Horses agus The Botanist ar Kew Green. Déanann Fulham Supporters Trust (Aib 2026) cur síos ar The Gunnersbury (590 Chiswick High Road) mar an teach tábhairne ainmnithe do na cuairteoirí agus molann siad áirithint.","Retained with eight points to spare, and the first English side to enter the European Cup against the League's wishes — Anderlecht were beaten 10–0 at Maine Road in September and Real Madrid ended the run in the semi-final. The Double was lost only at Wembley, where goalkeeper Ray Wood's cheekbone was broken after six minutes against Aston Villa and Jackie Blanchflower went in goal.":"Coinníodh é le hocht bpointe le spáráil, agus ba iad an chéad fhoireann Shasanach a chuaigh isteach i gCorn na hEorpa in aghaidh thoil na Sraithe — buadh 10–0 ar Anderlecht ag Maine Road i Meán Fómhair agus chuir Real Madrid deireadh leis an rith sa chluiche leathcheannais. Níor cailleadh an Dúbailt ach ag Wembley, áit ar briseadh cnámh leicne an chúl báire Ray Wood tar éis sé nóiméad in aghaidh Aston Villa agus chuaigh Jackie Blanchflower sa chúl.","Roads around the stadium close from three hours before kick-off until about one hour after the final whistle, and the ground is residential so keep noise down when leaving. Return via Norwood Junction (London Bridge), Selhurst (Victoria) or Thornton Heath (London Bridge or Clapham Junction); expect plenty of trains to London Bridge but a long wait for Clapham Junction services and a cramped away concourse. Last trains to Manchester: not stated; the N68 night bus serves evening matches.":"Dúntar na bóithre timpeall na staide ó thrí huaire an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh go dtí thart ar uair an chloig tar éis na feadóige deiridh, agus is ceantar cónaithe é, mar sin coinnigh an torann íseal agus tú ag imeacht. Fill trí Norwood Junction (London Bridge), Selhurst (Victoria) nó Thornton Heath (London Bridge nó Clapham Junction); bí ag súil le go leor traenacha go London Bridge ach fanacht fada ar sheirbhísí Clapham Junction agus halla cúng do na cuairteoirí. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain: níl siad luaite; freastalaíonn bus oíche N68 ar chluichí tráthnóna.","Ronaldo's 42 goals, the Ballon d'Or, and the Double of league and European Cup, fifty years after Munich. Tevez and Nani and Anderson arrived; the title was won at Wigan on the last day while Chelsea drew with Bolton. The final in Moscow, against Chelsea, was 1–1 after Ronaldo's header and Lampard's equaliser, and went to penalties: Ronaldo missed, John Terry slipped with the cup on his boot, and Van der Sar saved from Anelka.":"42 cúl Ronaldo, an Ballon d'Or, agus Dúbailt na sraithe agus Chorn na hEorpa, caoga bliain tar éis München. Tháinig Tevez, Nani agus Anderson; buadh an teideal ag Wigan an lá deiridh fad a chríochnaigh Chelsea cothrom le Bolton. Bhí an cluiche ceannais i Moscó, in aghaidh Chelsea, 1–1 tar éis chúl ceann Ronaldo agus chúl cothromaithe Lampard, agus chuaigh sé go ciceanna éirice: chaill Ronaldo, shleamhnaigh John Terry agus an corn ar a bhróg, agus shábháil Van der Sar ó Anelka.","Rooney's best season as a United player, 34 goals and both player-of-the-year awards, and the League Cup retained against Aston Villa with a late Rooney header from the bench. The title was lost by a point to Chelsea — the 2–1 defeat at Stamford Bridge in April, with Drogba's offside winner, was the hinge — and Bayern went through on away goals in the European quarter-final after Rafael's red card.":"An séasúr ab fhearr ag Rooney mar imreoir United, 34 cúl agus an dá ghradam imreoir na bliana, agus Corn na Sraithe coinnithe in aghaidh Aston Villa le cúl ceann déanach ó Rooney ón mbinse. Cailleadh an teideal le pointe in aghaidh Chelsea — ba é an briseadh 2–1 ag Stamford Bridge in Aibreán, le cúl an bhua ag Drogba ó fhreasach, an t-inse — agus chuaigh Bayern tríd ar chúil as baile sa chluiche ceathrú ceannais Eorpach tar éis chárta dearg Rafael.","Rossio Square and the surrounding streets in the centre are the usual base for away fans. Football Ground Guide lists bars such as The Red Frog Speakeasy, Artis Bar and Clube da Esquina, and sports bars The Couch, Alta Spot and Mignon; none are specifically away-fan pubs.":"Is iad Cearnóg Rossio agus na sráideanna máguaird i lár na cathrach an gnáthbhunáit do lucht leanúna an fhoirne as baile. Liostaíonn Football Ground Guide beáir mar The Red Frog Speakeasy, Artis Bar agus Clube da Esquina, agus beáir spóirt The Couch, Alta Spot agus Mignon; níl aon cheann acu ina theach tábhairne go sonrach do lucht leanúna as baile.","Selhurst Park is cashless (Apple Pay and Google Pay accepted). Visiting tickets are collected at Entrance 4; the Box Office closes two hours before kick-off. Views from the very back of the Arthur Wait Stand are poor, so arrive early; the concourse sells burgers, pies, chips and alcohol before kick-off and at half-time.":"Tá Selhurst Park gan airgead tirim (glactar le Apple Pay agus Google Pay). Bailítear ticéid cuairteoirí ag Bealach Isteach 4; dúnann an Box Office dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh. Bíonn na radhairc ó chúl an Arthur Wait Stand go dona, mar sin tar go luath; díolann an halla burgair, pióga, sceallóga agus alcól roimh an gcic tosaigh agus ag leath-am.","Selhurst, Thornton Heath and Norwood Junction stations are each about a 15-minute walk from the ground; do not use Crystal Palace station, which is two miles away. The club gives total journey times of about 40 minutes from Victoria (Southern to Selhurst), 30 minutes from London Bridge (Southern to Norwood Junction), 45 minutes from Waterloo via Clapham Junction, and 50 minutes from Euston or King's Cross via the Northern line to London Bridge. Taxis should drop off at the corner of Park Road and Whitehorse Lane at the visiting supporter end; there is no parking at the stadium and surrounding streets are permit holders only.":"Tá stáisiúin Selhurst, Thornton Heath agus Norwood Junction thart ar 15 nóiméad siúil an ceann ón staid; ná húsáid stáisiún Crystal Palace, atá dhá mhíle ar shiúl. Tugann an club amanna turais iomlána de thart ar 40 nóiméad ó Victoria (Southern go Selhurst), 30 nóiméad ó London Bridge (Southern go Norwood Junction), 45 nóiméad ó Waterloo trí Clapham Junction, agus 50 nóiméad ó Euston nó King's Cross tríd an líne Northern go London Bridge. Ba cheart do thacsaithe daoine a fhágáil ag cúinne Park Road agus Whitehorse Lane ag ceann lucht tacaíochta na gcuairteoirí; níl páirceáil ag an staid agus is do shealbhóirí ceadúnais amháin na sráideanna máguaird.","Squad from the club's first-team list (1 Sept 2026); portraits and bios from Wikipedia (Creative Commons); injuries, suspensions and season statistics from API-Football. United-career totals are being compiled and will appear next to the season figures.":"Scuad ó liosta chéad fhoireann an chlub (1 MFómh 2026); portráidí agus beathaisnéisí ó Wikipedia (Creative Commons); gortuithe, fionraí agus staitisticí an tséasúir ó API-Football. Táthar ag tiomsú iomlán gairme le United agus beidh siad le feiceáil in aice le figiúirí an tséasúir.","Strawberry Place and Leazes Terrace close from two hours before kick-off until roughly 30-45 minutes after full time, and Barrack Road closes 10 minutes before full time for 20-45 minutes, so allow extra time. Central Station is a ten-minute walk and Monument Metro five minutes; the Metrocentre Park and Ride returns from St James' Boulevard with the last bus one hour after the final whistle. Last trains to Manchester or London: not stated.":"Dúntar Strawberry Place agus Leazes Terrace ó dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh go dtí thart ar 30-45 nóiméad tar éis an lánama, agus dúntar Barrack Road 10 nóiméad roimh an lánam ar feadh 20-45 nóiméad, mar sin fág am breise. Tá Central Station siúlóid deich nóiméad ar shiúl agus Monument Metro cúig nóiméad; filleann Park and Ride an Metrocentre ó St James' Boulevard leis an mbus deireanach uair an chloig tar éis na feadóige deiridh. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain nó go Londain: níl siad luaite.","Sunderland railway station is the nearest main-line station, 10-15 minutes' walk from the ground (just under a mile, north along the riverbank). The Tyne and Wear Metro serves the ground via two stops: St Peter's (3 minutes' walk) and Stadium of Light (10 minutes' walk, deceptively named). Buses E2, 2, 3, 4, 9, 12, 13, 15, 16, 23, 24 and 56 stop nearby and Park Lane Interchange bus station is within walking distance; a free Park and Ride runs from Sunderland Enterprise Park off the A1231 every five minutes for 90 minutes before kick-off. Taxi drop-off is outside the Black Cat House store any time before kick-off.":"Is é stáisiún iarnróid Sunderland an stáisiún príomhlíne is gaire, 10-15 nóiméad siúil ón staid (beagán faoi mhíle, ó thuaidh feadh bhruach na habhann). Freastalaíonn an Tyne and Wear Metro ar an staid trí dhá stad: St Peter's (3 nóiméad siúil) agus Stadium of Light (10 nóiméad siúil, ainm míthreorach). Stopann busanna E2, 2, 3, 4, 9, 12, 13, 15, 16, 23, 24 agus 56 in aice láimhe agus tá stáisiún bus Park Lane Interchange laistigh d’achar siúil; ritheann Park and Ride saor in aisce ó Sunderland Enterprise Park amach ón A1231 gach cúig nóiméad ar feadh 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh. Fágtar daoine ó thacsaithe lasmuigh de shiopa Black Cat House am ar bith roimh an gcic tosaigh.","Ten years and three months after Munich, the European Cup. Hibernians of Malta, Sarajevo and Górnik Zabrze were beaten, then Real Madrid in the semi-final: 1–0 at Old Trafford, 3–1 down in the Bernabéu at half-time, then Sadler and Bill Foulkes — Munich survivor, centre-half — scored to go through 4–3. The final at Wembley was 1–1 after 90 minutes against Benfica and Eusébio; United scored three in the first eight minutes of extra time. Best won the Ballon d'Or; Busby was knighted.":"Deich mbliana agus trí mhí tar éis München, Corn na hEorpa. Buadh ar Hibernians as Málta, Sarajevo agus Górnik Zabrze, ansin ar Real Madrid sa chluiche leathcheannais: 1–0 ag Old Trafford, 3–1 síos sa Bernabéu ag leath-am, ansin scóráil Sadler agus Bill Foulkes — marthanóir München, lárchúlaí — le dul tríd 4–3. Bhí an cluiche ceannais ag Wembley 1–1 tar éis 90 nóiméad in aghaidh Benfica agus Eusébio; scóráil United trí cinn sna chéad ocht nóiméad den am breise. Bhuaigh Best an Ballon d'Or; rinneadh ridire de Busby.","The 12th FA Cup, 12 years after the 11th, and Van Gaal's only trophy — he was sacked two days after the final. Martial, 19, scored the stoppage-time winner against Everton in the semi-final; Marcus Rashford, 18, had burst in with two goals on his debut against Midtjylland in February and two more against Arsenal three days later. The final against Crystal Palace went to extra time after Puncheon's goal and Mata's reply; Lingard volleyed the winner with ten men after Smalling's red card.":"An 12ú FA Cup, 12 bliain tar éis an 11ú, agus an t-aon chorn ag Van Gaal — briseadh é dhá lá tar éis an chluiche ceannais. Scóráil Martial, 19, cúl an bhua san am cúitimh in aghaidh Everton sa chluiche leathcheannais; bhris Marcus Rashford, 18, isteach le dhá chúl ina chéad chluiche in aghaidh Midtjylland i bhFeabhra agus dhá cheann eile in aghaidh Arsenal trí lá ina dhiaidh sin. Chuaigh an cluiche ceannais in aghaidh Crystal Palace go dtí am breise tar éis chúl Puncheon agus freagra Mata; chuir Lingard volaí isteach mar chúl an bhua le deichniúr tar éis chárta dearg Smalling.","The 19th title, the one that passed Liverpool. Unbeaten at home all season, won only five away before February, and still champions by nine points; Chicharito, £7m from Guadalajara, scored 20; Berbatov shared the Golden Boot. Rooney's overhead kick beat City in February; the title was clinched at Blackburn with his penalty on 14 May. The season ended with Barcelona at Wembley — a 3–1 defeat Ferguson called the best side he had faced.":"An 19ú teideal, an ceann a chuaigh thar Liverpool. Gan chailleadh sa bhaile an séasúr ar fad, gan ach cúig bhua as baile roimh Fheabhra, agus seaimpíní fós le naoi bpointe; scóráil Chicharito, £7m ó Guadalajara, 20; roinn Berbatov an Bhróg Órga. Bhuaigh cic thar an gceann Rooney ar City i bhFeabhra; baineadh an teideal amach ag Blackburn lena chic éirice ar an 14 Bealtaine. Chríochnaigh an séasúr le Barcelona ag Wembley — briseadh 3–1 a dúirt Ferguson a bhí in aghaidh na foirne ab fhearr ar bhuail sé léi.","The 25 second-tier seasons (the last 1974-75) are left out of the rankings and quick picks unless you include them; divisions differ in strength and size. League games only: cup ties carry no points, and the archive holds every league game but not every cup tie, so there is no all-competitions view.":"Fágtar na 25 séasúr sa dara sraith (an ceann deireanach 1974-75) as na rangúcháin agus na roghanna tapa mura gcuireann tú san áireamh iad; tá difríocht idir na roinnte ó thaobh nirt agus méide. Cluichí sraithe amháin: ní thugann cluichí corn pointí, agus tá gach cluiche sraithe sa chartlann ach ní gach cluiche corn, mar sin níl amharc ar gach comórtas ann.","The 927 bus departs St Domingo Road (by the Valley Sports Bar) for 2.5 hours after the match, the 917 returns from Walton Lane, and the Soccerbus to Sandhills runs for 90 minutes after full-time. Expect long queues for the Soccerbus and busy bus stops, with Walton Breck Road closed to traffic as the crowd leaves; coaches leaving turn left. Last trains to Manchester: not stated.":"Fágann bus 927 St Domingo Road (in aice leis an Valley Sports Bar) ar feadh 2.5 uair an chloig tar éis an chluiche, filleann an 917 ó Walton Lane, agus ritheann an Soccerbus go Sandhills ar feadh 90 nóiméad tar éis an lánama. Bí ag súil le scuainí fada don Soccerbus agus stadanna bus plódaithe, le Walton Breck Road dúnta don trácht agus an slua ag imeacht; casann cóistí a fhágann ar chlé. Traenacha deireanacha go Manchain: níl siad luaite.","The Amex is fully cashless. Arrive early - the concourse opens 2 hours before kick-off and visiting fans are advised to arrive at least an hour before. Do not park on streets near the ground (residents' scheme, heavy ticketing); Park & Ride at Mill Road (fills about 1.5 hours before kick-off) or Brighton Racecourse must be pre-booked. Report anti-social behaviour by text to 07880 196442.":"Tá an Amex go hiomlán gan airgead tirim. Tar go luath - osclaíonn an halla 2 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh agus moltar do lucht leanúna cuairte teacht uair an chloig ar a laghad roimhe. Ná páirceáil ar shráideanna gar don staid (scéim chónaitheoirí, ticéid pháirceála go flúirseach); caithfear Park & Ride ag Mill Road (líonann thart ar 1.5 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh) nó Brighton Racecourse a chur in áirithe roimh ré. Tuairiscigh iompar frithshóisialta le téacs chuig 07880 196442.","The Busby Babes' first title, won with the youngest side the division had seen — average age 22 — by an eleven-point margin that stood as a record for decades. Duncan Edwards was 19, Eddie Colman 19, Byrne the senior man at 26. The championship was clinched with two games to spare against Blackpool, the only side still in range.":"An chéad teideal ag na Busby Babes, buaite leis an bhfoireann ab óige a chonaic an roinn — meánaois 22 — le bearna aon phointe déag a sheas mar thaifead ar feadh na mblianta fada. Bhí Duncan Edwards 19, Eddie Colman 19, agus Byrne an fear ba shine ag 26. Baineadh an craobh amach le dhá chluiche le spáráil in aghaidh Blackpool, an t-aon fhoireann a bhí fós in ann teacht suas.","The City Ground is cashless (card payments only). All tickets are digital for 2026/27 - have your phone charged with brightness up and the QR code ready; if there is a problem, the Visitors' Ticket Office Collection Point next to the away turnstiles opens 90 minutes before kick-off (proof of booking and photo ID required) and closes at half-time. Parking at the ground is very limited; use the approved car parks at Meadow Lane, Cattlemarket, Lady Bay Sports Ground or County Hall and avoid West Bridgford residential streets. Under-14s must be with an adult. Report anti-social behaviour by texting FOREST to 80800.":"Tá an City Ground gan airgead tirim (íocaíochtaí cárta amháin). Tá gach ticéad digiteach do 2026/27 - bíodh do ghuthán luchtaithe leis an ngile in airde agus an cód QR réidh; má bhíonn fadhb ann, osclaíonn Pointe Bailiúcháin Oifig Ticéad na gCuairteoirí in aice le geataí casta na gcuairteoirí 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh (cruthúnas áirithinte agus aitheantas grianghrafach ag teastáil) agus dúnann sé ag leath-am. Tá páirceáil ag an staid an-teoranta; úsáid na carrchlóis cheadaithe ag Meadow Lane, Cattlemarket, Lady Bay Sports Ground nó County Hall agus seachain sráideanna cónaithe West Bridgford. Ní foláir do dhaoine faoi 14 a bheith le duine fásta. Tuairiscigh iompar frithshóisialta trí FOREST a théacsáil chuig 80800.","The Glazer takeover summer, Keane's departure in November after the MUTV interview, out of the Champions League at the group stage for the first time in a decade — and a League Cup won 4–0 against Wigan in Cardiff, with Rooney scoring twice. Van Nistelrooy was left on the bench for the final and left for Madrid in the summer. Edwin van der Sar and Park Ji-sung arrived; the side that would win three straight titles was forming.":"Samhradh ghabháil seilbhe na Glazers, imeacht Keane i mí na Samhna tar éis an agallaimh ar MUTV, amach as Sraith na Seaimpíní ag céim na ngrúpaí den chéad uair le deich mbliana — agus Corn na Sraithe buaite 4–0 in aghaidh Wigan i gCaerdydd, le Rooney ag scóráil faoi dhó. Fágadh Van Nistelrooy ar an mbinse don chluiche ceannais agus d’imigh sé go Maidrid sa samhradh. Tháinig Edwin van der Sar agus Park Ji-sung; bhí an fhoireann a bhuafadh trí theideal as a chéile ag teacht le chéile.","The Nest (Iremonger Road, NG2 3HU, next to Notts County's Meadow Lane) is Nottingham's dedicated away-fan fanzone, about a 10-minute walk from the away turnstiles and on the direct walking route from the station, with capacity for over 1300, big screen, bars and street food; it opens only to away ticket holders on selected matchdays (free tickets may be required) - see nestnotts.co.uk. No pubs are named by the sources.":"Is é The Nest (Iremonger Road, NG2 3HU, in aice le Meadow Lane Notts County) crios lucht leanúna tiomnaithe Nottingham do lucht leanúna as baile, thart ar 10 nóiméad siúil ó gheataí casta na gcuairteoirí agus ar an mbealach siúil díreach ón stáisiún, le hacmhainn do bhreis is 1300, scáileán mór, beáir agus bia sráide; ní osclaíonn sé ach do shealbhóirí ticéad as baile ar laethanta cluiche roghnaithe (d’fhéadfadh go mbeadh ticéid saor in aisce ag teastáil) - féach nestnotts.co.uk. Ní ainmníonn na foinsí aon teach tábhairne.","The Stadium of Light is cashless, card only; the away concourse has two food and drink courtyards open from turnstiles opening, at half time and for 30 minutes after full time. Strict no re-admission. Supporter Liaison Officer: chris.waters@safc.com; asksafc.com handles pre-match queries.":"Tá an Stadium of Light gan airgead tirim, cárta amháin; tá dhá chlós bia agus dí ag halla na gcuairteoirí ar oscailt ó oscailt na ngeataí casta, ag leath-am agus ar feadh 30 nóiméad tar éis an lánama. Gan athiontráil ar chor ar bith. Oifigeach Idirchaidrimh Lucht Tacaíochta: chris.waters@safc.com; láimhseálann asksafc.com fiosruithe roimh an gcluiche.","The Treble. Thirty-three games unbeaten from Boxing Day to the end of May, every competition decided in the final ten days. The league was won on the last day against Tottenham after going a goal down; the FA Cup final against Newcastle was 2–0, four days after the semi-final replay against Arsenal that Schmeichel's penalty save and Giggs's run had turned; and in Barcelona on 26 May, trailing to Mario Basler's sixth-minute free-kick for 85 minutes, Sheringham and Solskjær scored from two Beckham corners in injury time. Keane's semi-final at Juventus — booked, knowing he would miss the final, and dragging United from 2–0 down to win 3–2 — is the performance Ferguson rated above any other.":"An Trébhuach. Tríocha trí chluiche gan chailleadh ó Lá Fhéile Stiofáin go deireadh na Bealtaine, gach comórtas socraithe sna deich lá deiridh. Buadh an tsraith an lá deiridh in aghaidh Tottenham tar éis dul cúl síos; bhí cluiche ceannais an FA Cup in aghaidh Newcastle 2–0, ceithre lá tar éis athimirt an chluiche leathcheannais in aghaidh Arsenal a d’athraigh sábháil cic éirice Schmeichel agus rith Giggs; agus i mBarcelona ar an 26 Bealtaine, taobh thiar de chic saor Mario Basler sa séú nóiméad ar feadh 85 nóiméad, scóráil Sheringham agus Solskjær ó dhá chic choirnéil Beckham san am cúitimh. Is é cluiche leathcheannais Keane ag Juventus — cárta buí, a fhios aige go gcaillfeadh sé an cluiche ceannais, agus é ag tarraingt United ó 2–0 síos chun buachan 3–2 — an taispeántas a mheas Ferguson thar aon cheann eile.","The arena is about 4 miles north of Coventry railway station (15-20 minutes by road), so it is not walkable from town. The club-subsidised shuttle bus costs £5 return (contactless only, no one-way tickets), picking up at the rail replacement stop by Coventry station (near Central Six) and White Street Coach Park, from three hours before kick-off at half-hour intervals until one hour before, dropping at the bus station at Arena Park shopping centre. Coventry Arena station is on site but has no special matchday service and only takes short trains. By public bus: No. 9 from the station to the Transport Museum, then No. 3 from Trinity Street or No. 5 from Pool Meadow to Arena Park (Tesco) and through the underpass. A taxi from the centre is around £15.":"Tá an airéine thart ar 4 mhíle ó thuaidh de stáisiún iarnróid Coventry (15-20 nóiméad ar an mbóthar), mar sin ní féidir siúl ann ón mbaile. Cosnaíonn an bus tointeála a fhóirdheonaíonn an club £5 fillte (gan teagmháil amháin, gan ticéid aon tslí), ag piocadh suas ag stad na seirbhíse ionadaí iarnróid in aice le stáisiún Coventry (gar do Central Six) agus White Street Coach Park, ó thrí huaire an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh gach leathuair go dtí uair an chloig roimhe, agus fágann sé daoine ag an stáisiún bus ag ionad siopadóireachta Arena Park. Tá stáisiún Coventry Arena ar an láthair ach níl seirbhís speisialta lae cluiche ann agus ní ghlacann sé ach traenacha gearra. Ar bhus poiblí: Uimh. 9 ón stáisiún go dtí an Transport Museum, ansin Uimh. 3 ó Trinity Street nó Uimh. 5 ó Pool Meadow go Arena Park (Tesco) agus tríd an bhfobhealach. Cosnaíonn tacsaí ón lár thart ar £15.","The arena's prohibited items list bans large bags and suitcases but gives no size limit; also banned are glasses, bottles and cans, outside food and drink, cameras, computer tablets, long umbrellas, flagpoles, selfie sticks, air horns, fireworks and flares, baby buggies and prams, and flags over 2m x 1m. Bags may be searched on entry; no locker or left-luggage option is stated.":"Cuireann liosta earraí toirmiscthe na hairéine cosc ar mhálaí móra agus ar chásanna taistil ach ní thugann sé teorainn mhéide; tá cosc freisin ar ghloiní, buidéil agus cannaí, bia agus deoch ón taobh amuigh, ceamaraí, táibléid ríomhaireachta, scáthanna fearthainne fada, cuaillí bratach, maidí féinphictiúr, adharca aeir, tinte ealaíne agus bladhmanna, bugaithe agus pramanna leanaí, agus bratacha os cionn 2m x 1m. D’fhéadfaí málaí a chuardach ag an iontráil; ní luaitear taisceadán ná áis fhágála bagáiste.","The club guide names no pubs. Football Ground Guide names The Arkles (77 Anfield Road) as the main pub for travelling fans a few minutes from the ground, plus The Flat Iron (Walton Breck Road) and The Thomas Frost Wetherspoons (Walton Road), and says many visiting fans drink in the city centre around Concert Square, Bold Street or Mathew Street before heading to the ground.":"Ní ainmníonn treoir an chlub aon teach tábhairne. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide The Arkles (77 Anfield Road) mar an príomhtheach tábhairne do lucht leanúna taistil cúpla nóiméad ón staid, chomh maith le The Flat Iron (Walton Breck Road) agus The Thomas Frost Wetherspoons (Walton Road), agus deir sé go n-ólann go leor cuairteoirí i lár na cathrach timpeall Concert Square, Bold Street nó Mathew Street sula dtéann siad chuig an staid.","The club names The Station Hotel opposite the railway station as the official away pub (garden, TV screens, Greene King beers); most pubs around the ground are home only and the Portman Road FanZone is home fans only. For those arriving via the A14 the club lists The Maltings in Stowmarket, the Sorrel Horse in Barham and the Live Lounge in Stowmarket as away-friendly. Football Ground Guide also names the Lord Nelson, Dove Street Inn and Isaacs on the Quay.":"Ainmníonn an club The Station Hotel os comhair an stáisiúin iarnróid mar an teach tábhairne oifigiúil do na cuairteoirí (gairdín, scáileáin teilifíse, beoir Greene King); is do lucht leanúna baile amháin formhór na dtithe tábhairne timpeall na staide agus is do lucht leanúna baile amháin Portman Road FanZone. Dóibh siúd a thagann tríd an A14 liostaíonn an club The Maltings i Stowmarket, an Sorrel Horse i Barham agus an Live Lounge i Stowmarket mar áiteanna atá fáilteach do chuairteoirí. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide freisin an Lord Nelson, Dove Street Inn agus Isaacs on the Quay.","The club names no away pubs and says local pubs are used by home supporters; drinking in public areas is not allowed across Greater Manchester. Football Ground Guide says most away fans drink in the city centre and take the tram out, lists The Townley, Grove Inn and The Corner Shop as City pubs where colours should not be worn, says Mary D's should be avoided, and specifically tells Manchester United fans to use the city centre.":"Ní ainmníonn an club aon teach tábhairne do na cuairteoirí agus deir sé go n-úsáideann lucht tacaíochta baile na tithe tábhairne áitiúla; níl cead ól i limistéir phoiblí ar fud Greater Manchester. Deir Football Ground Guide go n-ólann formhór lucht leanúna as baile i lár na cathrach agus go dtógann siad an tram amach, liostaíonn sé The Townley, Grove Inn agus The Corner Shop mar thithe tábhairne City nár cheart dathanna a chaitheamh iontu, deir sé gur cheart Mary D's a sheachaint, agus deir sé go sonrach le lucht leanúna Manchester United lár na cathrach a úsáid.","The club page names no pubs. Football Ground Guide names The Prince George (2 High Street, Thornton Heath) as the most popular, about a 10-minute walk, plus The Railway Telegraph (Brigstock Road, Thornton Heath), The Clifton Arms (Clifton Road, SE25) and The White Horse (Selhurst Road, SE25).":"Ní ainmníonn leathanach an chlub aon teach tábhairne. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide The Prince George (2 High Street, Thornton Heath) mar an ceann is mó éileamh, thart ar 10 nóiméad siúil, chomh maith le The Railway Telegraph (Brigstock Road, Thornton Heath), The Clifton Arms (Clifton Road, SE25) agus The White Horse (Selhurst Road, SE25).","The club recommends The Longford Engine, 270 Bedworth Road, CV6 6BP, a 17-minute walk from the arena. Football Ground Guide adds the Bull and Anchor (Wheelwright Lane, about 10 minutes), The Old Crown, Byatts Brewery and Dhillon's Brewery. Options around the ground are limited, so drinking in the city centre before travelling out is the usual choice.":"Molann an club The Longford Engine, 270 Bedworth Road, CV6 6BP, 17 nóiméad siúil ón airéine. Cuireann Football Ground Guide leis an Bull and Anchor (Wheelwright Lane, thart ar 10 nóiméad), The Old Crown, Byatts Brewery agus Dhillon's Brewery. Tá na roghanna timpeall na staide teoranta, mar sin is é ól i lár na cathrach sula dtaistealaíonn tú amach an gnáthrogha.","The club says there is no designated away pub and some nearby venues may refuse visiting supporters, particularly in colours, but Shearer's Bar under the Gallowgate Stand is open to all supporters and The Gate and Chinatown are a short walk away. Football Ground Guide names The Head of Steam and The Newcastle Tap (Neville Street, by Central Station), Percy Arms (Percy Street), The Trent House (Leazes Lane), and says The Strawberry near the ground generally admits away fans.":"Deir an club nach bhfuil teach tábhairne ainmnithe do na cuairteoirí agus go bhféadfadh roinnt ionad in aice láimhe lucht tacaíochta cuairte a dhiúltú, go háirithe i ndathanna, ach tá Shearer's Bar faoin Gallowgate Stand ar oscailt do gach lucht tacaíochta agus tá The Gate agus Chinatown siúlóid ghearr ar shiúl. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide The Head of Steam agus The Newcastle Tap (Neville Street, in aice le Central Station), Percy Arms (Percy Street), The Trent House (Leazes Lane), agus deir sé go ligeann The Strawberry gar don staid lucht leanúna as baile isteach de ghnáth.","The club states none of the pubs around Stamford Bridge admit visiting fans and that the nearest away-friendly pubs are in Earl's Court, about 25 to 30 minutes' walk (1.4 miles). Football Ground Guide names The Courtfield Tavern (opposite Earl's Court station), The Goose (248 North End Road), The Blackbird and Earl's Court Tavern (Earls Court Road).":"Deir an club nach ligeann aon cheann de na tithe tábhairne timpeall Stamford Bridge lucht leanúna cuairte isteach agus go bhfuil na tithe tábhairne is gaire atá fáilteach do chuairteoirí in Earl's Court, thart ar 25 go 30 nóiméad siúil (1.4 míle). Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide The Courtfield Tavern (os comhair stáisiún Earl's Court), The Goose (248 North End Road), The Blackbird agus Earl's Court Tavern (Earls Court Road).","The club strongly advises against bringing a bag; if you must, it has to be a clear carrier bag up to 30cm x 30cm or a personal bag no larger than A4 (21cm x 30cm); laptop sleeves up to 37cm x 31cm. Expect longer queues with a bag and airport-style searches. No bag drop or storage is provided.":"Molann an club go láidir gan mála a thabhairt leat; má chaithfidh tú, ní foláir gur mála iompair glan suas le 30cm x 30cm é nó mála pearsanta nach mó ná A4 (21cm x 30cm); clúdaigh ríomhaire glúine suas le 37cm x 31cm. Bí ag súil le scuainí níos faide le mála agus cuardaigh ar nós aerfoirt. Ní sholáthraítear áit fhágála ná stóráil málaí.","The club's first league title, six years after the Newton Heath rescue and still playing at Bank Street, Clayton. Mangnall's side had been assembled cheaply from the Manchester City players banned over illegal payments — Billy Meredith, Sandy Turnbull, Herbert Burgess and Jimmy Bannister — and ran away with the championship by nine points. Turnbull's 25 goals were the division's most.":"An chéad teideal sraithe ag an gclub, sé bliana tar éis tarrtháil Newton Heath agus é fós ag imirt ag Bank Street, Clayton. Bailíodh foireann Mangnall go saor ó imreoirí Manchester City a cuireadh faoi chosc mar gheall ar íocaíochtaí neamhdhleathacha — Billy Meredith, Sandy Turnbull, Herbert Burgess agus Jimmy Bannister — agus bhuaigh siad an craobh go réidh le naoi bpointe. Ba iad 25 cúl Turnbull an líon ba mhó sa roinn.","The club's guide directs visiting fans to pubs around Keel Square and High Street West in the city centre (then over the Keel Crossing footbridge to the ground), Sheepfolds Stables street food and bars on the route, the Fans Museum between Roker and the stadium (open to away fans, serves drinks), and pubs along Roker seafront; the Beacon of Light Fanzone next to the stadium is open to both sets of fans from two and a half hours before kick-off. Football Ground Guide names Greens, Streetbar SR1, The Albion, The Wheatsheaf and The Avenue as away-friendly.":"Treoraíonn treoir an chlub lucht leanúna cuairte chuig tithe tábhairne timpeall Keel Square agus High Street West i lár na cathrach (ansin thar an droichead coisithe Keel Crossing go dtí an staid), bia sráide agus beáir Sheepfolds Stables ar an mbealach, an Fans Museum idir Roker agus an staid (ar oscailt do lucht leanúna as baile, díoltar deochanna ann), agus tithe tábhairne feadh chois farraige Roker; tá an Beacon of Light Fanzone in aice leis an staid ar oscailt don dá dhream lucht leanúna ó dhá uair go leith roimh an gcic tosaigh. Ainmníonn Football Ground Guide Greens, Streetbar SR1, The Albion, The Wheatsheaf agus The Avenue mar áiteanna atá fáilteach do chuairteoirí.","The first Double, and nearly a treble — the League Cup final was lost to Aston Villa in March. Roy Keane came from Forest for a British record £3.75m; Cantona was Footballer of the Year. United led the league from August, saw a 16-point gap shrink to three as Blackburn chased, then won six of the last seven. The FA Cup final was 4–0 against Chelsea, who had beaten United twice in the league, with Cantona scoring two penalties in the rain.":"An chéad Dúbailt, agus beagnach Trébhuach — cailleadh cluiche ceannais Chorn na Sraithe in aghaidh Aston Villa i Márta. Tháinig Roy Keane ó Forest ar thaifead Briotanach £3.75m; ba é Cantona Peileadóir na Bliana. Bhí United ar barr na sraithe ó Lúnasa, chonaic siad bearna 16 phointe ag laghdú go trí phointe agus Blackburn sa tóir, ansin bhuaigh siad sé cinn de na seacht gcluiche dheireanacha. Bhí cluiche ceannais an FA Cup 4–0 in aghaidh Chelsea, a bhuaigh ar United faoi dhó sa tsraith, le Cantona ag scóráil dhá chic éirice sa bháisteach.","The first FA Cup. United beat Brighton, Everton, Blackburn, Burnley and Newcastle on the way to the final at Crystal Palace, where Sandy Turnbull scored the only goal against Bristol City after a Harold Halse shot hit the bar. The same season the club also won the first Charity Shield (1908) and began building Old Trafford, which opened in February 1910.":"An chéad FA Cup. Bhuaigh United ar Brighton, Everton, Blackburn, Burnley agus Newcastle ar an mbealach go dtí an cluiche ceannais ag Crystal Palace, áit ar scóráil Sandy Turnbull an t-aon chúl in aghaidh Bristol City tar éis d’urchar Harold Halse an trasnán a bhualadh. An séasúr céanna bhuaigh an club an chéad Charity Shield (1908) freisin agus thosaigh sé ag tógáil Old Trafford, a osclaíodh i bhFeabhra 1910.","The first title in 26 years and the first of the Premier League. United were tenth in November when Eric Cantona arrived from Leeds for £1.2m; they lost twice in the remaining 28 league games. The pivot was 10 April against Sheffield Wednesday: 1–0 down with four minutes left, Bruce headed two, the second in the seventh minute of stoppage time, and Ferguson and Brian Kidd ended up on the pitch. The title was confirmed on 2 May when Villa lost to Oldham; United beat Blackburn the next night and lifted the trophy.":"An chéad teideal le 26 bliain agus an chéad cheann sa Premier League. Bhí United sa deichiú háit i mí na Samhna nuair a tháinig Eric Cantona ó Leeds ar £1.2m; níor chaill siad ach dhá uair sna 28 cluiche sraithe a bhí fágtha. Ba é an 10 Aibreán in aghaidh Sheffield Wednesday an mhaighdeog: 1–0 síos le ceithre nóiméad fágtha, chuir Bruce dhá cheann lena cheann, an dara ceann sa seachtú nóiméad den am cúitimh, agus bhí Ferguson agus Brian Kidd ar an bpáirc. Deimhníodh an teideal ar an 2 Bealtaine nuair a chaill Villa in aghaidh Oldham; bhuaigh United ar Blackburn an oíche dár gcionn agus d’ardaigh siad an corn.","The first title since Munich, taken from Leeds on goal average after both finished on 61 points — the closest finish the division had seen. Law scored 28 in the league and 39 in all competitions and was named European Footballer of the Year; Best, 18, played every league game. The decisive stretch was April: Leeds beaten 1–0 at Elland Road, then seven straight wins.":"An chéad teideal ó München, bainte de Leeds ar mheán cúl tar éis don bheirt críochnú ar 61 pointe — an críochnú ba ghaire dá bhfaca an roinn. Scóráil Law 28 sa tsraith agus 39 i ngach comórtas agus ainmníodh é mar Pheileadóir Eorpach na Bliana; d’imir Best, 18, gach cluiche sraithe. Ba é Aibreán an tréimhse chinniúnach: bua 1–0 ar Leeds ag Elland Road, ansin seacht mbua as a chéile.","The first title won at Old Trafford, settled on the last afternoon. United needed to beat Sunderland and hope Villa slipped at Liverpool; they won 5–1 and Villa lost 3–1. Mangnall left for Manchester City the following year, and it would be 41 years before the next championship.":"An chéad teideal a buadh ag Old Trafford, socraithe an tráthnóna deireanach. Bhí ar United buachan ar Sunderland agus súil a bheith acu go sleamhnódh Villa ag Liverpool; bhuaigh siad 5–1 agus chaill Villa 3–1. D’imigh Mangnall go Manchester City an bhliain dár gcionn, agus bheadh 41 bliain ann roimh an gcéad chraobh eile.","The first trophy in six years, in Ten Hag's first season. Ronaldo left in November after the Piers Morgan interview; Rashford scored 30; Casemiro arrived from Real Madrid and scored the first goal in the final against Newcastle, Sven Botman's own goal the second. The FA Cup final — the first Manchester derby final — was lost 2–1 to City, who went on to the treble.":"An chéad chorn le sé bliana, i gcéad séasúr Ten Hag. D’imigh Ronaldo i mí na Samhna tar éis an agallaimh le Piers Morgan; scóráil Rashford 30; tháinig Casemiro ó Real Madrid agus scóráil sé an chéad chúl sa chluiche ceannais in aghaidh Newcastle, féinchúl Sven Botman an dara ceann. Cailleadh cluiche ceannais an FA Cup — an chéad chluiche ceannais idir an dá chlub as Manchain — 2–1 in aghaidh City, a bhuaigh an Trébhuach ina dhiaidh sin.","The ground is just under 10 minutes' walk from Ipswich railway station (about a quarter of a mile: straight over the bridge from the station, right at the Royal Mail sorting office). The town centre is less than 10 minutes' walk away. Trains run from London Liverpool Street (Greater Anglia, 2-3 an hour, about 70 minutes on faster services) and hourly from Peterborough with short 4-coach trains that get very busy. A London Road Park and Ride bus stops a short walk from the stadium.":"Tá an staid beagán faoi 10 nóiméad siúil ó stáisiún iarnróid Ipswich (thart ar cheathrú míle: díreach thar an droichead ón stáisiún, ar dheis ag oifig sórtála Royal Mail). Tá lár an bhaile níos lú ná 10 nóiméad siúil ar shiúl. Ritheann traenacha ó London Liverpool Street (Greater Anglia, 2-3 san uair, thart ar 70 nóiméad ar sheirbhísí níos tapúla) agus gach uair an chloig ó Peterborough le traenacha gearra 4 charráiste a éiríonn an-ghnóthach. Stopann bus Park and Ride London Road siúlóid ghearr ón staid.","The largest winning margin in Premier League history at the time — 18 points — with eleven straight wins to finish. United did not defend the FA Cup, going to Brazil for the Club World Championship instead, but in November had beaten Palmeiras in Tokyo to be world champions: Keane scored, Mark Bosnich made the saves. The European Cup went at the quarter-final, 3–2 at home to Real Madrid after a 0–0 in the Bernabéu.":"An bhearna bhuach ba mhó i stair an Premier League ag an am — 18 bpointe — le haon bhua déag as a chéile ag an deireadh. Níor chosain United an FA Cup, ag dul go dtí an Bhrasaíl do Chraobh Dhomhanda na gClubanna ina ionad, ach i mí na Samhna bhí an bua faighte acu ar Palmeiras i dTóiceo le bheith ina seaimpíní domhanda: scóráil Keane, rinne Mark Bosnich na sábhálacha. Cailleadh Corn na hEorpa sa chluiche ceathrú ceannais, 3–2 sa bhaile in aghaidh Real Madrid tar éis 0–0 sa Bernabéu.","The nearest tube is Fulham Broadway (District line, Wimbledon branch; change at Earl's Court if needed), 5 to 10 minutes' walk; it is step-free with lifts. West Brompton and Imperial Wharf (Overground, between Clapham Junction and Willesden Junction) are about 15 minutes' walk. Buses 14, 211 and 414 stop outside on Fulham Road. Fulham Road between Harwood Road and Hortensia Road closes 90 minutes before kick-off until about an hour after; parking is residents-only, so the club advises public transport.":"Is é Fulham Broadway (líne District, craobh Wimbledon; athraigh ag Earl's Court más gá) an tiúb is gaire, 5 go 10 nóiméad siúil; tá sé gan chéimeanna le hardaitheoirí. Tá West Brompton agus Imperial Wharf (Overground, idir Clapham Junction agus Willesden Junction) thart ar 15 nóiméad siúil. Stopann busanna 14, 211 agus 414 lasmuigh ar Fulham Road. Dúntar Fulham Road idir Harwood Road agus Hortensia Road 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh go dtí thart ar uair an chloig ina dhiaidh; is do chónaitheoirí amháin an pháirceáil, mar sin molann an club iompar poiblí.","The official 2026/27 away guide says small bags are OK and will be searched, larger bags and luggage are not allowed and there is no storage, so avoid bringing a bag; Villa's own matchday pages say no bags larger than A4, all bags are searched and bags can be registered at villa.dropmybag.co.uk. Flags and banners need a photo emailed to the club at least 3 days before.":"Deir treoir oifigiúil as baile 2026/27 go bhfuil málaí beaga ceart go leor agus go gcuardófar iad, nach gceadaítear málaí níos mó ná bagáiste agus nach bhfuil stóráil ann, mar sin seachain mála a thabhairt leat; deir leathanaigh lae cluiche Villa féin gan málaí níos mó ná A4, go gcuardaítear gach mála agus gur féidir málaí a chlárú ag villa.dropmybag.co.uk. Teastaíonn grianghraf a sheoladh chuig an gclub trí ríomhphost 3 lá ar a laghad roimh ré do bhratacha agus meirgí.","The one that kept Ferguson in the job, or so the story goes: United finished 13th and had been out of the top half most of the season. Mark Robins' header at Forest in the third round started a run of away draws all the way to Wembley. The final against Crystal Palace was 3–3, Hughes equalising in extra time; Ferguson dropped Jim Leighton for the replay and Les Sealey kept a clean sheet as Lee Martin's goal won it.":"An ceann a choinnigh Ferguson sa phost, de réir an scéil: chríochnaigh United sa 13ú háit agus bhí siad as an leath uachtarach an chuid is mó den séasúr. Chuir cúl ceann Mark Robins ag Forest sa tríú babhta tús le sraith tarraingtí as baile an bealach ar fad go Wembley. Bhí an cluiche ceannais in aghaidh Crystal Palace 3–3, Hughes ag cothromú san am breise; d’fhág Ferguson Jim Leighton as don athimirt agus choinnigh Les Sealey cúl glan agus cúl Lee Martin a bhuaigh é.","The season the title slipped — top in April, then four games in eight days and Leeds went past — but two cups came in. Red Star Belgrade, European champions, were beaten 1–0 in the Super Cup at Old Trafford in November, and McClair's goal won the first League Cup against Nottingham Forest in April. Peter Schmeichel arrived in the summer; Ryan Giggs, 18, was PFA Young Player of the Year.":"An séasúr a shleamhnaigh an teideal — ar barr in Aibreán, ansin ceithre chluiche in ocht lá agus chuaigh Leeds thar United — ach tháinig dhá chorn. Buadh 1–0 ar Red Star Belgrade, seaimpíní na hEorpa, sa Sárchorn ag Old Trafford i mí na Samhna, agus bhuaigh cúl McClair an chéad Chorn na Sraithe in aghaidh Nottingham Forest in Aibreán. Tháinig Peter Schmeichel sa samhradh; ba é Ryan Giggs, 18, Imreoir Óg na Bliana PFA.","The stadium and campus are fully cashless. The stadium opens two hours before kick-off; arriving early avoids peak transport and security queues. Touchline Grills and Tap Inns in the visitors' section open two hours before kick-off; every attendee, including babes in arms, needs a ticket. For United's 23 May visit the trips page assumes a day trip via Stansted - the 06:00 Ryanair out and an evening flight home.":"Tá an staid agus an campas go hiomlán gan airgead tirim. Osclaíonn an staid dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh; seachnaíonn teacht go luath buaicscuainí iompair agus slándála. Osclaíonn Touchline Grills agus Tap Inns i rannóg na gcuairteoirí dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh; teastaíonn ticéad ó gach duine a fhreastalaíonn, naíonáin i mbaclainn san áireamh. Do chuairt United ar 23 Bealtaine glacann leathanach na dturas le turas lae trí Stansted - an Ryanair 06:00 amach agus eitilt tráthnóna abhaile.","The stadium is about 4 miles from Brighton city centre, so do not try to walk from Brighton station. Take a train from Brighton station to Falmer (about 7-10 minutes, roughly four trains an hour on matchdays); Falmer station is about 250m from the stadium and a short walk to the South Stand away end. Trains are very busy, so Brighton advise boarding around an hour before kick-off, or use Lewes (one stop beyond Falmer) as a quieter alternative. Bus 25 stops at Village Way (nearest stop) and bus 23 serves Falmer village and station; buses do not run from Brighton station itself. Your match ticket gives free train and bus travel in the Free Travel Zone from 3.5 hours before kick-off until 3.5 hours after the final whistle - fans from London only need a rail ticket as far as Haywards Heath.":"Tá an staid thart ar 4 mhíle ó lár chathair Brighton, mar sin ná déan iarracht siúl ó stáisiún Brighton. Tóg traein ó stáisiún Brighton go Falmer (thart ar 7-10 nóiméad, timpeall ceithre thraein san uair ar laethanta cluiche); tá stáisiún Falmer thart ar 250m ón staid agus siúlóid ghearr go ceann na gcuairteoirí sa South Stand. Bíonn na traenacha an-ghnóthach, mar sin molann Brighton dul ar bord thart ar uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh, nó úsáid Lewes (stad amháin thar Falmer) mar rogha níos ciúine. Stopann bus 25 ag Village Way (an stad is gaire) agus freastalaíonn bus 23 ar shráidbhaile agus ar stáisiún Falmer; ní ritheann busanna ó stáisiún Brighton féin. Tugann do thicéad cluiche taisteal traenach agus bus saor in aisce sa Free Travel Zone ó 3.5 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh go dtí 3.5 uair an chloig tar éis na feadóige deiridh - ní theastaíonn ó lucht leanúna ó Londain ach ticéad iarnróid chomh fada le Haywards Heath.","The stadium is about 7km north of the centre. Visiting clubs (Tottenham 2022, Arsenal 2024) tell away fans to take the Green (Verde) metro line from Rossio/Baixa to Telheiras, about 15 minutes, then walk roughly 10 minutes to the away gate under police direction; both stations are step-free. Do not get off at Campo Grande, which is next to the stadium but reserved for home fans and described as strictly forbidden for away supporters. Fans are also advised to stay in the city centre and avoid the stadium area until travelling to the match.":"Tá an staid thart ar 7km ó thuaidh den lár. Deir clubanna cuairte (Tottenham 2022, Arsenal 2024) le lucht leanúna as baile an líne Ghlas (Verde) den mheitreo a thógáil ó Rossio/Baixa go Telheiras, thart ar 15 nóiméad, agus ansin siúl thart ar 10 nóiméad go geata na gcuairteoirí faoi stiúir na bpóilíní; tá an dá stáisiún gan chéimeanna. Ná tuirlingigh ag Campo Grande, atá in aice leis an staid ach curtha in áirithe do lucht leanúna an fhoirne baile agus a ndeirtear go bhfuil sé go hiomlán toirmiscthe do lucht tacaíochta as baile. Moltar do lucht leanúna fanacht i lár na cathrach freisin agus limistéar na staide a sheachaint go dtí go mbíonn siad ag taisteal chuig an gcluiche.","The stadium is cashless. Only travel with a valid ticket; no upgrades on the day, and bring photo ID to collect a pre-arranged duplicate from the main ticket office. Food and drink are served in the away section; redevelopment works around the ground mean you should allow extra time and follow stewards.":"Tá an staid gan airgead tirim. Ná taistil ach le ticéad bailí; gan uasghráduithe ar an lá, agus tabhair aitheantas grianghrafach leat chun dúblach réamhshocraithe a bhailiú ón bpríomhoifig ticéad. Freastalaítear bia agus deoch i rannóg na gcuairteoirí; ciallaíonn oibreacha athfhorbartha timpeall na staide gur cheart duit am breise a fhágáil agus na maoir a leanúint.","The stadium is cashless; the away end sells food and drink from two hours before afternoon games (6.30pm before evening games) with an Early Bird pie-and-pint offer up to 45 minutes before kick-off. Tickets are emailed as PDFs to scan on your phone; the Match Day Box Office is next to the Armoury store on the west side and opens 3 hours before kick-off. Buggies and prams are not allowed and under-14s must be with an adult.":"Tá an staid gan airgead tirim; díolann ceann na gcuairteoirí bia agus deoch ó dhá uair an chloig roimh chluichí tráthnóna (6.30pm roimh chluichí oíche) le tairiscint Early Bird pióg agus pionta suas le 45 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh. Seoltar ticéid trí ríomhphost mar PDFanna le scanadh ar do ghuthán; tá an Match Day Box Office in aice le siopa Armoury ar an taobh thiar agus osclaíonn sé 3 huaire an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh. Ní cheadaítear bugaithe ná pramanna agus ní foláir do dhaoine faoi 14 a bheith le duine fásta.","The stadium is fully cashless (contactless, Apple Pay, Google Pay; chip and PIN over £45). Arrive early - turnstiles open 90 minutes before kick-off and searches are thorough. Early Bird prices in the away kiosks for the first 30 minutes after opening (£4 draught beer, £4 pies); alcohol may be withdrawn for high-risk fixtures. Report issues by texting BFC plus your message to 62277. For ticket problems on the day go to the stadium Box Office before entering.":"Tá an staid go hiomlán gan airgead tirim (gan teagmháil, Apple Pay, Google Pay; sliseanna agus PIN os cionn £45). Tar go luath - osclaíonn na geataí casta 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh agus bíonn na cuardaigh mionchúiseach. Praghsanna Early Bird i gciosceanna na gcuairteoirí don chéad 30 nóiméad tar éis oscailte (£4 beoir bhairille, £4 pióga); d’fhéadfaí alcól a tharraingt siar do chluichí ardriosca. Tuairiscigh fadhbanna trí BFC móide do theachtaireacht a théacsáil chuig 62277. Le haghaidh fadhbanna ticéad ar an lá téigh chuig Box Office na staide sula dtéann tú isteach.","The stadium is in the town itself, about 10 minutes' walk north of the centre. Vila-real station is on the Renfe Cercanías C-6 line between València Nord and Castelló: around 50 to 60 minutes from Valencia and 10 to 20 minutes from Castellón, with several trains an hour off-peak; the walk from the station to the ground is flat and takes 15 to 20 minutes. Most away fans stay in Valencia or Castellón because hotels in Vila-real are very limited. UK government advice for United's 2021 visit quoted taxis at about EUR 80 to Valencia and EUR 20 to Castellón.":"Tá an staid sa bhaile féin, thart ar 10 nóiméad siúil ó thuaidh den lár. Tá stáisiún Vila-real ar líne Renfe Cercanías C-6 idir València Nord agus Castelló: thart ar 50 go 60 nóiméad ó Valencia agus 10 go 20 nóiméad ó Castellón, le roinnt traenacha san uair lasmuigh de bhuaicamanna; tá an tsiúlóid ón stáisiún go dtí an staid cothrom agus tógann sí 15 go 20 nóiméad. Fanann formhór lucht leanúna as baile i Valencia nó Castellón mar go bhfuil óstáin i Vila-real an-teoranta. Luaigh comhairle rialtas na Ríochta Aontaithe do chuairt United in 2021 tacsaithe ag thart ar EUR 80 go Valencia agus EUR 20 go Castellón.","The title back after three years of Arsenal and Chelsea. Ronaldo, booed everywhere after the World Cup, won both player-of-the-year awards; Scholes was reborn in a deeper role; Vidić and Evra settled. Roma were beaten 7–1 at Old Trafford in April; Milan ended the European run in the semi-final. The championship came on 6 May when Chelsea drew with Arsenal the day after Ronaldo's penalty beat City at the Etihad.":"An teideal ar ais tar éis trí bliana de Arsenal agus Chelsea. Bhuaigh Ronaldo, a ndearnadh fonóid faoi i ngach áit tar éis Chorn an Domhain, an dá ghradam imreoir na bliana; athbheochan ar Scholes i ról níos doimhne; shocraigh Vidić agus Evra isteach. Buadh 7–1 ar Roma ag Old Trafford in Aibreán; chuir Milan deireadh leis an rith Eorpach sa chluiche leathcheannais. Tháinig an craobh ar an 6 Bealtaine nuair a chríochnaigh Chelsea cothrom le Arsenal an lá tar éis do chic éirice Ronaldo buachan ar City ag an Etihad.","The treble season, 1998–99, is the only time an English club has won the league, FA Cup and European Cup in one year. Last trophy: the 2024 FA Cup. 2025–26: 3rd in the Premier League on 71 points, back in the Champions League.":"Is é séasúr an Trébhuaigh, 1998–99, an t-aon uair a bhuaigh club Sasanach an tsraith, an FA Cup agus Corn na hEorpa in aon bhliain amháin. An corn deireanach: FA Cup 2024. 2025–26: 3ú sa Premier League le 71 pointe, ar ais i Sraith na Seaimpíní.","The trophy that stopped Liverpool's treble. Docherty's young wing-heavy side had lost the previous year's final to Southampton; this time they beat the league champions and European Cup finalists with two goals in five second-half minutes, Jimmy Greenhoff's winner deflecting in off his chest from Lou Macari's shot. Docherty was sacked six weeks later.":"An corn a chuir stop le Trébhuach Liverpool. Chaill foireann óg Docherty, a bhí láidir ar na heití, cluiche ceannais na bliana roimhe in aghaidh Southampton; an uair seo bhuaigh siad ar sheaimpíní na sraithe agus ar fhoireann chluiche ceannais Chorn na hEorpa le dhá chúl i gcúig nóiméad sa dara leath, cúl an bhua ag Jimmy Greenhoff ag athrú treo isteach dá chliabh ó urchar Lou Macari. Briseadh Docherty sé seachtaine ina dhiaidh sin.","The worst league season since 1990 and the 13th FA Cup, won against Manchester City at Wembley with two first-half goals from academy graduates: Garnacho after Ortega and Gvardiol collided, Mainoo from Fernandes's pass. Doku pulled one back late. It was the second consecutive derby final and the first United had won; Ten Hag kept his job on the strength of it, for five more months.":"An séasúr sraithe ba mheasa ó 1990 agus an 13ú FA Cup, buaite in aghaidh Manchester City ag Wembley le dhá chúl sa chéad leath ó chéimithe an acadaimh: Garnacho tar éis d’Ortega agus Gvardiol imbhualadh, Mainoo ó phas Fernandes. Fuair Doku ceann ar ais go déanach. Ba é an dara cluiche ceannais as a chéile idir an dá chlub as Manchain é agus an chéad cheann a bhuaigh United; choinnigh Ten Hag a phost dá bharr, ar feadh cúig mhí eile.","Three in a row for the first time in the club's history, with Sheringham, 35, as Footballer of the Year and PFA Player of the Year. The gap was 16 points in March. Arsenal were beaten 6–1 at Old Trafford in February, Yorke scoring a hat-trick in the first 22 minutes; the title arrived on 14 April after Arsenal lost at Middlesbrough and United beat Coventry.":"Trí cinn as a chéile den chéad uair i stair an chlub, le Sheringham, 35, mar Pheileadóir na Bliana agus Imreoir na Bliana PFA. Bhí an bhearna 16 phointe i Márta. Buadh 6–1 ar Arsenal ag Old Trafford i bhFeabhra, Yorke ag scóráil haitric sna chéad 22 nóiméad; tháinig an teideal ar an 14 Aibreán tar éis do Arsenal cailleadh ag Middlesbrough agus do United buachan ar Coventry.","Three in a row for the second time, equalling Liverpool's 18 titles. Van der Sar went 1,311 league minutes without conceding, a record; Berbatov came from Spurs for £30.75m; Rooney, Ronaldo and Tevez shared the goals. The Club World Cup was won in Yokohama in December, the League Cup on penalties against Tottenham in March, the title with a 0–0 against Arsenal in May. The Champions League final in Rome was lost 2–0 to Barcelona, and Ronaldo left for Madrid for £80m.":"Trí cinn as a chéile don dara huair, ag cothromú 18 dteideal Liverpool. Chuaigh Van der Sar 1,311 nóiméad sraithe gan chúl a ligean isteach, taifead; tháinig Berbatov ó Spurs ar £30.75m; roinn Rooney, Ronaldo agus Tevez na cúil. Buadh Corn Domhanda na gClubanna i Yokohama i mí na Nollag, Corn na Sraithe ar chiceanna éirice in aghaidh Tottenham i Márta, an teideal le 0–0 in aghaidh Arsenal i mBealtaine. Cailleadh cluiche ceannais Shraith na Seaimpíní sa Róimh 2–0 in aghaidh Barcelona, agus d’imigh Ronaldo go Maidrid ar £80m.","Tickets are digital/print-at-home and sent to the lead booker about five days before the game; download them before you set off and do not travel without one. Aim to be at the gate at least an hour before kick-off. Kiosks were card-only at Arsenal's visit; watch for pickpockets and keep passport and cash separate.":"Tá na ticéid digiteach/le priontáil sa bhaile agus seoltar iad chuig an bpríomhdhuine a rinne an áirithint thart ar chúig lá roimh an gcluiche; íoslódáil iad sula n-imíonn tú agus ná taistil gan ceann. Bí ag an ngeata uair an chloig ar a laghad roimh an gcic tosaigh. Ní ghlac na ciosceanna ach le cártaí ag cuairt Arsenal; bí ar an airdeall faoi phiocadóirí póca agus coinnigh pas agus airgead tirim óna chéile.","Traffic around the ground is heavy after the game; allow 20 to 45 minutes to clear the area, or walk back to Boscombe/Pokesdown (about 15 minutes) or take a bus to Bournemouth Square. Last train times to London or Manchester: not stated; post-match journeys are much longer on engineering-work weekends, so check your route.":"Bíonn an trácht timpeall na staide trom tar éis an chluiche; fág 20 go 45 nóiméad leis an gceantar a fhágáil, nó siúil ar ais go Boscombe/Pokesdown (thart ar 15 nóiméad) nó tóg bus go Bournemouth Square. Amanna na traenach deireanaí go Londain nó go Manchain: níl siad luaite; bíonn turais tar éis an chluiche i bhfad níos faide ar dheireadh seachtaine le hoibreacha innealtóireachta, mar sin seiceáil do bhealach.","Trophies are those United won in a season he played for the club: an appearance in the squad list (1993/94 on), or a goal or a final before that. Seasons inside his Wikipedia career years with no appearance on record are listed apart. A loan spell away is not checked, and a player who left mid-season is still counted for that season. Final line-ups are recorded to 1992/93.":"Is iad na cornanna na cinn a bhuaigh United i séasúr inar imir sé don chlub: láithriú ar liosta an scuaid (1993/94 ar aghaidh), nó cúl nó cluiche ceannais roimhe sin. Liostaítear ar leith séasúir laistigh de bhlianta a ghairme ar Wikipedia gan láithriú taifeadta. Ní sheiceáiltear tréimhse iasachta in áit eile, agus comhairtear imreoir a d’imigh i lár séasúir don séasúr sin fós. Taifeadtar foirne na gcluichí ceannais go 1992/93.","Two cups in Mourinho's first season, plus the Community Shield; the league was 25 games unbeaten and still only sixth, with 15 draws. Ibrahimović, 35, scored 28, two of them in the League Cup final against Southampton — the winner a header in the 87th minute. Pogba returned for a world-record £89m. The Europa League, the one European trophy United had never won, was taken in Stockholm against Ajax two days after the Manchester Arena bombing: Pogba and Mkhitaryan, and a Champions League place.":"Dhá chorn i gcéad séasúr Mourinho, móide an Community Shield; bhí an tsraith 25 cluiche gan chailleadh agus fós sa séú háit amháin, le 15 chomhscór. Scóráil Ibrahimović, 35, 28, dhá cheann acu i gcluiche ceannais Chorn na Sraithe in aghaidh Southampton — cúl an bhua ina chúl ceann sa 87ú nóiméad. D’fhill Pogba ar thaifead domhanda £89m. Buadh Sraith Europa, an t-aon chorn Eorpach nár bhuaigh United riamh, i Stócólm in aghaidh Ajax dhá lá tar éis bhuamáil an Manchester Arena: Pogba agus Mkhitaryan, agus áit i Sraith na Seaimpíní.","United's away allocation is sold on tickets.manutd.com to members in order of away credits (your members' login). The host club's ticket office is the other official route — their home areas, members' schemes and hospitality. Football tickets may only be resold in the UK by the clubs or their authorised partners, so unofficial resale sites are left out.":"Díoltar leithdháileadh as baile United ar tickets.manutd.com le baill in ord a gcreidmheasanna as baile (logáil isteach na mball). Is í oifig ticéad an chlub óstaigh an bealach oifigiúil eile — a limistéir bhaile, a scéimeanna ball agus a bhfáilteachas. Ní féidir ticéid pheile a athdhíol sa Ríocht Aontaithe ach ag na clubanna nó a gcomhpháirtithe údaraithe, mar sin fágtar suíomhanna athdhíola neamhoifigiúla as.","Valencia Airport (VLC), about 70km south, is the practical gateway: metro into Valencia then Cercanías C-6 to Vila-real, roughly an hour from the city. The trips page notes no direct CPH flight that week (one stop via Amsterdam).":"Is é Valencia Airport (VLC), thart ar 70km ó dheas, an geata praiticiúil: meitreo isteach go Valencia agus ansin Cercanías C-6 go Vila-real, thart ar uair an chloig ón gcathair. Tugann leathanach na dturas faoi deara nach raibh eitilt dhíreach ó CPH an tseachtain sin (stad amháin trí Amstardam).","Villa Park is cashless (cash back available at the ticket office with a £3.50 minimum spend; nearest cash machine at Tesco Extra, Aston Lane). Have your ticket ready - barriers with ticket checks are sometimes used at the turnstiles. Alcohol is sold only in Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (none in Upper Block P, no transfers) and not at all for some fixtures - call 0333 323 1874 to check. Upper tier fans should buy programmes from the Witton Lane kiosks before entering. Uncollected tickets go to the visitors' ticket office on Witton Lane opposite the away coach park, open about 90 minutes before kick-off. Follow @WMPVillaFC for travel updates.":"Tá Villa Park gan airgead tirim (airgead ar ais ar fáil ag an oifig ticéad le híoschaiteachas £3.50; an meaisín airgid is gaire ag Tesco Extra, Aston Lane). Bíodh do thicéad réidh - úsáidtear bacainní le seiceálacha ticéad ag na geataí casta uaireanta. Ní dhíoltar alcól ach i Doug Ellis Lower Block Q (níl aon cheann in Upper Block P, gan aistrithe) agus ní dhíoltar ar chor ar bith é do roinnt cluichí - glaoigh ar 0333 323 1874 le seiceáil. Ba cheart do lucht leanúna sa leibhéal uachtarach cláir chluiche a cheannach ó chiosceanna Witton Lane sula dtéann siad isteach. Téann ticéid nár bailíodh chuig oifig ticéad na gcuairteoirí ar Witton Lane os comhair charrchlós chóistí na gcuairteoirí, ar oscailt thart ar 90 nóiméad roimh an gcic tosaigh. Lean @WMPVillaFC le haghaidh nuashonruithe taistil.","Villa say there is no dedicated away pub or bar near the ground and advise drinking in Birmingham city centre. Football Ground Guide lists The Witton Arms (Witton Road), The Bartons Arms (High Street, Aston) and The Yew Tree (Brookvale Road) but warns some pubs check tickets.":"Deir Villa nach bhfuil teach tábhairne ná beár tiomnaithe do na cuairteoirí gar don staid agus molann siad ól i lár chathair Birmingham. Liostaíonn Football Ground Guide The Witton Arms (Witton Road), The Bartons Arms (High Street, Aston) agus The Yew Tree (Brookvale Road) ach tugann sé rabhadh go seiceálann roinnt tithe tábhairne ticéid.","Visiting fans are in the Anfield Road Stand (allocation around 3000 for league games) with licensed safe standing in rows 6-35. Enter via gates Q and R, approaching Anfield Road from the 97 Avenue direction; there is no access from Arkles Lane. Turnstiles open 2 hours before kick-off.":"Tá lucht leanúna cuairte san Anfield Road Stand (leithdháileadh thart ar 3000 do chluichí sraithe) le seasamh sábháilte ceadúnaithe i sraitheanna 6-35. Téigh isteach trí gheataí Q agus R, ag druidim le Anfield Road ó threo 97 Avenue; níl rochtain ó Arkles Lane. Osclaíonn na geataí casta 2 uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh.","Visiting fans are usually held in the stadium for 20 to 30 minutes after the final whistle. For a 21:00 kick-off Manchester City's 2025/26 guide warned that public transport from Villarreal stops at 22:00 local time, so there are no trains or buses after the game and only a few taxis; pre-book coaches or taxis back to Valencia or Castellón. For daytime games the Cercanías platform fills quickly after the whistle, so buy a return ticket on arrival.":"De ghnáth coinnítear lucht leanúna cuairte sa staid ar feadh 20 go 30 nóiméad tar éis na feadóige deiridh. Do chic tosaigh 21:00 thug treoir 2025/26 Manchester City rabhadh go stopann an t-iompar poiblí ó Villarreal ag 22:00 am áitiúil, mar sin níl traenacha ná busanna ann tar éis an chluiche agus gan ach cúpla tacsaí; cuir cóistí nó tacsaithe ar ais go Valencia nó Castellón in áirithe roimh ré. Do chluichí i rith an lae líonann ardán Cercanías go tapa tar éis na feadóige, mar sin ceannaigh ticéad fillte nuair a shroicheann tú.","Visiting supporters are in Blocks 114 to 118 in the north-east corner, lower tier (Block 234 for accessible seating). Approach via Worcester Avenue and use Entrances 11 and 12 (11a is the accessible entrance); there is a security cordon, metal detector and pat-down before the ticket turnstiles.":"Tá lucht tacaíochta cuairte i mBloic 114 go 118 sa chúinne thoir thuaidh, an leibhéal íochtarach (Bloc 234 do shuíocháin inrochtana). Tar isteach trí Worcester Avenue agus úsáid Bealaí Isteach 11 agus 12 (is é 11a an bealach isteach inrochtana); tá cordún slándála, brathadóir miotail agus cuardach láimhe ann roimh gheataí casta na dticéad.","Visiting supporters are in the corner of the Arthur Wait Stand next to the Whitehorse Lane end (around 2000 places); the away turnstiles are on one side of the Arthur Wait Stand and away fans usually use entrances 4, 5, 6 or 7. Turnstiles open around two hours before kick-off.":"Tá lucht tacaíochta cuairte i gcúinne an Arthur Wait Stand in aice le ceann Whitehorse Lane (thart ar 2000 áit); tá geataí casta na gcuairteoirí ar thaobh amháin den Arthur Wait Stand agus de ghnáth úsáideann lucht leanúna as baile bealaí isteach 4, 5, 6 nó 7. Osclaíonn na geataí casta thart ar dhá uair an chloig roimh an gcic tosaigh.","Witton station can have large queues after the match, with extra football services running to Birmingham New Street; the city centre shuttle bus also runs back to Dudley Street. Driving away can be slow (one reviewer reported about 90 minutes to rejoin the motorway). Last-train times: not stated.":"D’fhéadfadh scuainí móra a bheith ag stáisiún Witton tar éis an chluiche, le seirbhísí peile breise ag rith go Birmingham New Street; ritheann bus tointeála lár na cathrach ar ais go Dudley Street freisin. D’fhéadfadh tiomáint as a bheith mall (thuairiscigh léirmheastóir amháin thart ar 90 nóiméad le filleadh ar an mótarbhealach). Amanna na traenach deireanaí: níl siad luaite.","Won with ten men. Kevin Moran became the first player sent off in an FA Cup final, for a foul on Peter Reid with twelve minutes left; Everton, league champions and Cup Winners' Cup winners that week, were going for a treble. Whiteside's curling winner from the right in the 110th minute decided it. Hughes, 21, and Robson were the season's players; Hughes was PFA Young Player of the Year.":"Buaite le deichniúr. Ba é Kevin Moran an chéad imreoir a cuireadh den pháirc i gcluiche ceannais an FA Cup, as calaois ar Peter Reid le dhá nóiméad déag fágtha; bhí Everton, seaimpíní na sraithe agus buaiteoirí Chorn Bhuaiteoirí na gCorn an tseachtain sin, ag iarraidh Trébhuach. Shocraigh cúl cuartha Whiteside ón taobh deas sa 110ú nóiméad é. Ba iad Hughes, 21, agus Robson imreoirí an tséasúir; ba é Hughes Imreoir Óg na Bliana PFA.","Your question picks out the players, seasons, clubs or managers it mentions; their pages' data goes to the model with the question; nothing else does. Answers are cached, so a repeated question is instant. There's a limit of 20 questions an hour per visitor. Check the linked pages before quoting a figure — it's a summary of what's here, not a source in itself.":"Piocann do cheist amach na himreoirí, na séasúir, na clubanna nó na bainisteoirí a luann sí; téann sonraí a leathanach chuig an tsamhail leis an gceist; ní théann aon rud eile. Cuirtear freagraí i dtaisce, mar sin bíonn ceist arís láithreach. Tá teorainn de 20 ceist san uair in aghaidh an chuairteora. Seiceáil na leathanaigh nasctha sula luann tú figiúr — achoimre é ar a bhfuil anseo, ní foinse ann féin."});
